      <data key="d2">Objective: Defeat a zombie with a wooden sword while health recovers only twice as fast as normal.
Description: The agent must earn the `DEFEAT_ZOMBIE` achievement. The player begins on Floor 0 (the overworld) with a wooden sword already in inventory. One zombie (melee mob type 0) and three cows (passive mob type 0) are placed randomly within a Manhattan distance of 4–8 blocks from the player’s starting position. All survival needs are active at default rates, but health regeneration is set to 2.0× the original speed (down from 5.0× in the parent task). Passive and melee mob spawning remain at normal levels, while ranged mobs spawn at a reduced rate (0.2) to keep the focus on melee combat. This configuration forces the agent to manage the fight more carefully, as it can no longer rely on extremely fast healing.
Relevant Achievements: DEFEAT_ZOMBIE
Completed Achievements: MAKE_WOOD_SWORD
World:
- Player: Starts on floor 0. Inventory: `{"sword": 1}`.
- Map: Place one `ZOMBIE` (melee mob, type_id=0) and three `COW` (passive mob, type_id=0) randomly within 4–8 Manhattan tiles of the player’s start, using `add_mobs_randomly_near`.
- Mechanics:
  - health_recover_multiplier = 2.0
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0
  - passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0
  - melee_spawn_multiplier = 1.0
  - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.2
  (All other TaskParams remain at their default values.)</data>
