      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to descend to the dungeon using the ladder on floor 0.
Description: The player begins on floor 0 with a wood pickaxe and wood sword already in inventory, and the achievements for collecting wood and crafting those tools are considered completed. A single Ladder Down block is placed exactly 2 tiles to the east of the spawn position, and all hostile mob spawning is disabled. Survival needs are nearly eliminated (needs depletion multiplier 0.1) and health regeneration is boosted to prevent any accidental death. The only goal is to walk to the ladder and execute the DESCEND action, thereby unlocking the ENTER_DUNGEON achievement. No combat, crafting, or resource gathering is required.
Relevant Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON
Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD
World:
- Player: Starts on floor 0 with inventory: wood pickaxe (1), wood sword (1). All other stats are default (full health/food/drink/mana/energy).
- Map: On floor 0, place exactly one LADDER_DOWN block at the coordinate (player_spawn_row, player_spawn_col + 2). The exact player spawn is the center of the map (e.g., row = map_height // 2, col = map_width // 2). No other block modifications are made. No mobs are added initially.
- Mechanics: passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0, melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0, ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0, needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.1, health_recover_multiplier = 10.0. All other TaskParams remain at their default values.</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement, BlockType, ItemType
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Learn to descend to the dungeon using the ladder on floor 0.
Description: The player begins on floor 0 with a wood pickaxe and wood sword already in inventory, and the achievements for collecting wood and crafting those tools are considered completed. A single Ladder Down block is placed exactly 2 tiles to the east of the spawn position, and all hostile mob spawning is disabled. Survival needs are nearly eliminated (needs depletion multiplier 0.1) and health regeneration is boosted to prevent any accidental death. The only goal is to walk to the ladder and execute the DESCEND action, thereby unlocking the ENTER_DUNGEON achievement. No combat, crafting, or resource gathering is required.
Relevant Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON
Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD
World:
- Player: Starts on floor 0 with inventory: wood pickaxe (1), wood sword (1). All other stats are default (full health/food/drink/mana/energy).
- Map: On floor 0, place exactly one LADDER_DOWN block at the coordinate (player_spawn_row, player_spawn_col + 2). The exact player spawn is the center of the map (e.g., row = map_height // 2, col = map_width // 2). No other block modifications are made. No mobs are added initially.
- Mechanics: passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0, melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0, ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0, needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.1, health_recover_multiplier = 10.0. All other TaskParams remain at their default values.
"""

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON]
        self.completed_achievements = [
            Achievement.COLLECT_WOOD,
            Achievement.MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE,
            Achievement.MAKE_WOOD_SWORD,
        ]
        self.label = "ENTER_DUNGEON"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        """Return custom parameters for this task."""
        return TaskParams(
            passive_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            melee_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            ranged_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            needs_depletion_multiplier=0.1,
            health_recover_multiplier=10.0,
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        """Generates the world for the task."""
        rng, build_rng = jax.random.split(rng)

        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)

        builder.set_starting_floor(0)
        builder.set_player_inventory({"pickaxe": 1, "sword": 1})

        # Get player spawn position (center of map)
        player_pos = builder.player_position
        ladder_pos = (player_pos[0], player_pos[1] + 2)

        # Place Ladder Down block as an item on the ground
        builder.item_map = builder.item_map.at[0, ladder_pos[0], ladder_pos[1]].set(
            ItemType.LADDER_DOWN.value
        )

        state = builder.build(rng)

        # Mark the pre‑completed achievements in the initial state
        achievement_indices = jax.numpy.array([a.value for a in self.completed_achievements])
        state = state.replace(
            achievements=state.achievements.at[achievement_indices].set(True)
        )

        return state</data>
