- Player: Starts on floor 0 with inventory: wood pickaxe (1), wood sword (1), wood (5). No other items.
- Map: On floor 0, place a CRAFTING_TABLE block directly adjacent to the player’s spawn location (one cell to the right, if passable). Use `place_randomly_near` to place 5 STONE blocks within min_dist=2, max_dist=5 of the player’s spawn position, on any non‑solid ground (GRASS, PATH, etc.). Add 2 ZOMBIE melee mobs (`mob_name="melee", type_id=0`) randomly within min_dist=8, max_dist=12 of the player, on passable terrain. Do not add any passive or ranged mobs.
