Relevant Achievements: COLLECT_IRON

Completed Achievements: MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_TORCH, PLACE_TORCH, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

