      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn the DESCEND action to enter the dungeon.
Description: The agent must achieve `ENTER_DUNGEON` by descending from the overworld to floor 1. The player starts on floor 0 with a wooden sword already in hand. All mob spawns (passive, melee, ranged) are disabled to eliminate combat and reduce distractions. A ladder‑down block is placed on floor 0 within a Manhattan distance of 3 to 6 tiles from the player’s starting center (position (24,24)). No other world modifications are made. Survival needs are kept at default depletion and regeneration rates. The episode ends successfully as soon as the agent descends.
Relevant Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON
Completed Achievements: MAKE_WOOD_SWORD
