      <data key="d2">Objective: Defeat a single Orc Soldier on the Dungeon floor (Level 1) using a pre‑equipped iron sword, with no survival pressure and no other hostile mobs.

Description: The agent starts on Floor 1 (Dungeon) at the ladder‑up arrival point. Its inventory contains an iron sword (tier 3), and it has full health/energy. All survival needs (hunger, thirst, fatigue) are disabled by setting `needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0`, so the agent never loses food/water/energy and takes no starvation damage. Health regeneration is moderately boosted (`health_recover_multiplier = 2.0`) to help recover from Orc Soldier melee hits. All mob spawns are suppressed (`melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`, `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`, `passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`); the only hostile entity is a single Orc Soldier placed via the world builder. The Orc Soldier (melee mob, `mob_name = "melee"`, `type_id = 2`) is spawned on any walkable Dungeon tile (e.g., `BlockType.PATH`) at a Manhattan distance between 4 and 8 from the player’s starting position. The agent must locate and kill this Orc Soldier to succeed.

Relevant Achievements: DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER
Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, MAKE_IRON_SWORD
World:
- Player: Starting floor 1; inventory contains an iron sword (`{"sword": 3}`). All other stats default.
- Map: On Floor 1, place one Orc Soldier (`mob_name = "melee"`, `type_id = 2`) randomly within Manhattan distance 4–8 from the player’s starting position, using `on_blocks = [BlockType.PATH]` to ensure walkable placement.
- Mechanics: 
    "needs_depletion_multiplier": 0.0,
    "health_recover_multiplier": 2.0,
    "melee_spawn_multiplier": 0.0,
    "passive_spawn_multiplier": 0.0,
    "ranged_spawn_multiplier": 0.0</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement, BlockType
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Defeat a single Orc Soldier on the Dungeon floor (Level 1) using a pre‑equipped iron sword, with no survival pressure and no other hostile mobs.

Description: The agent starts on Floor 1 (Dungeon) at the ladder‑up arrival point. Its inventory contains an iron sword (tier 3), and it has full health/energy. All survival needs (hunger, thirst, fatigue) are disabled by setting `needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0`, so the agent never loses food/water/energy and takes no starvation damage. Health regeneration is moderately boosted (`health_recover_multiplier = 2.0`) to help recover from Orc Soldier melee hits. All mob spawns are suppressed (`melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`, `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`, `passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`); the only hostile entity is a single Orc Soldier placed via the world builder. The Orc Soldier (melee mob, `mob_name = "melee"`, `type_id = 2`) is spawned on any walkable Dungeon tile (e.g., `BlockType.PATH`) at a Manhattan distance between 4 and 8 from the player’s starting position. The agent must locate and kill this Orc Soldier to succeed.

Relevant Achievements: DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER
Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, MAKE_IRON_SWORD
World:
- Player: Starting floor 1; inventory contains an iron sword (`{"sword": 3}`). All other stats default.
- Map: On Floor 1, place one Orc Soldier (`mob_name = "melee"`, `type_id = 2`) randomly within Manhattan distance 4–8 from the player’s starting position, using `on_blocks = [BlockType.PATH]` to ensure walkable placement.
- Mechanics: 
    "needs_depletion_multiplier": 0.0,
    "health_recover_multiplier": 2.0,
    "melee_spawn_multiplier": 0.0,
    "passive_spawn_multiplier": 0.0,
    "ranged_spawn_multiplier": 0.0
    """

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [Achievement.DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER]
        self.completed_achievements = [
            Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON,
            Achievement.MAKE_IRON_SWORD,
        ]
        self.label = "DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        """Return custom parameters for this task."""
        return TaskParams(
            needs_depletion_multiplier=0.0,
            health_recover_multiplier=2.0,
            melee_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            passive_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            ranged_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        """Generates the world for the task."""
        rng, build_rng, mob_rng = jax.random.split(rng, 3)

        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)

        # Start on floor 1 (Dungeon)
        builder.set_starting_floor(1)

        # Equip an iron sword (tier 3)
        builder.set_player_inventory({"sword": 3})

        # Place a single Orc Soldier (melee type_id=2) 4-8 tiles away on PATH
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            mob_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="melee",
            type_id=2,  # Orc Soldier
            n=1,
            target_pos=builder.player_position,
            min_dist=4,
            max_dist=8,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH],
        )

        return builder.build(rng)</data>
