    <node id="task_120">
      <data key="d0">desc_generated</data>
      <data key="d1">generated</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to fight Orc Soldiers and Orc Mages, eat Snails for food, and clear floor 1 to descend to the Gnomish Mines.
Description: The agent begins on floor 1 (the Dungeon) with an iron sword, iron pickaxe, and a modest supply of torches, wood, stone, and coal. No monsters have been killed yet (`set_monsters_killed(level=1, count=0)`), so the ladder down to floor 2 is locked. To succeed, the agent must explore the procedurally‑generated rooms, place torches to navigate the dark, defeat a mix of melee Orc Soldiers and ranged Orc Mages until the kill counter reaches the required 8 (`monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 8`), then stand on the down ladder and DESCEND. Hunger and thirst deplete at half the normal rate to keep survival pressure manageable, but the agent will need to eat Snails (found near spawn) to avoid starvation. Combat difficulty is softened slightly: mob health and damage are both set to 80% of normal. Ranged mobs are enabled for the first time, forcing the agent to handle kiting Orc Mages. The only “down” ladder on floor 1 is placed randomly on PATH within 2–10 tiles of the player’s spawn to ensure discoverability. Three passive Snails are placed within 4–10 tiles on PATH to guarantee early food. All other floors remain in their default generated state, but the task terminates upon successfully descending to floor 2.
Relevant Achievements: DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE, EAT_SNAIL, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES
Completed Achievements: MAKE_IRON_PICKAXE, MAKE_IRON_SWORD
World:
- Player: Starts on floor 1. Inventory: `{"pickaxe": 3, "sword": 3, "wood": 20, "stone": 20, "coal": 10, "torch": 10}` (iron pickaxe = tier 3, iron sword = tier 3). Stats: dexterity=1, strength=1, intelligence=1. Kill counter for floor 1 is manually set to 0 using `builder.set_monsters_killed(level=1, count=0)`.
- Map: On floor 1, one `LADDER_DOWN` block is placed randomly using `builder.place_randomly_near(rng, level=1, block_type=BlockType.LADDER_DOWN, target_pos=&lt;player_spawn_on_floor_1&gt;, min_dist=2, max_dist=10, n=1, on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH])`. Additionally, 3 `SNAIL` passive mobs (mob_name "snail", type_id=2) are placed using `builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(rng, level=1, mob_name="snail", type_id=2, n=3, target_pos=&lt;player_spawn_on_floor_1&gt;, min_dist=4, max_dist=10, on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH])`.
- Mechanics:
  - `melee_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`
  - `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`
  - `passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`
  - `mob_health_multiplier = 0.8`
  - `mob_damage_multiplier = 0.8`
  - `needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.5`
  - `health_recover_multiplier = 1.0`
  - `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 8`</data>
