    <node id="task_121">
      <data key="d0">A</data>
      <data key="d1">generated</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective: Chain the early‐game sequence of crafting a stone sword, entering the Dungeon, and defeating an Orc Soldier – converting isolated combat skill into a reliable next‐stage transition.

Description:
The agent starts on floor 0 (Overworld) with an empty inventory and default stats (STR 1, DEX 1, INT 1; all needs maxed). No hostile mobs spawn anywhere (melee and ranged multipliers set to 0.0). The overworld contains the standard distribution of trees, stone, coal, and iron; no additional modifications. The dungeon (floor 1) contains exactly one Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) placed randomly at a Manhattan distance of 1–3 from the up‐ladder to guarantee quick encounter after descent. The ladder down on floor 0 is open from the beginning (0 kills required). The episode terminates in success only when all three achievements – `MAKE_STONE_SWORD`, `ENTER_DUNGEON`, and `DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER` – have been obtained.

Relevant Achievements: MAKE_STONE_SWORD, ENTER_DUNGEON, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER
Completed Achievements: (none)
World:
- Player: Start on floor 0. Inventory empty. Stats default.
- Map: On floor 1, add one Orc Soldier (`mob_name="melee"`, `type_id=2`) randomly within 1–3 Manhattan distance of the up‐ladder position.
- Mechanics:
    * `passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`
    * `melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`
    * `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`
    * `monsters_killed_to_clear_level` for floor 0 set to 0
    * All other `TaskParams` at default.</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement, BlockType
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Chain the early‐game sequence of crafting a stone sword, entering the Dungeon, and defeating an Orc Soldier – converting isolated combat skill into a reliable next‐stage transition.

    Description:
    The agent starts on floor 0 (Overworld) with an empty inventory and default stats (STR 1, DEX 1, INT 1; all needs maxed). No hostile mobs spawn anywhere (melee and ranged multipliers set to 0.0). The overworld contains the standard distribution of trees, stone, coal, and iron; no additional modifications. The dungeon (floor 1) contains exactly one Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) placed randomly at a Manhattan distance of 1–3 from the up‐ladder to guarantee quick encounter after descent. The ladder down on floor 0 is open from the beginning (0 kills required). The episode terminates in success only when all three achievements – `MAKE_STONE_SWORD`, `ENTER_DUNGEON`, and `DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER` – have been obtained.

    Relevant Achievements: MAKE_STONE_SWORD, ENTER_DUNGEON, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER
    Completed Achievements: (none)
    World:
    - Player: Start on floor 0. Inventory empty. Stats default.
    - Map: On floor 1, add one Orc Soldier (`mob_name="melee"`, `type_id=2`) randomly within 1–3 Manhattan distance of the up‐ladder position.
    - Mechanics:
        * `passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`
        * `melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`
        * `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`
        * `monsters_killed_to_clear_level` for floor 0 set to 0
        * All other `TaskParams` at default.
    """

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_SWORD,
            Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON,
            Achievement.DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER,
        ]
        self.completed_achievements = []
        self.label = "MAKE_STONE_SWORD, ENTER_DUNGEON, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        """Return custom parameters for this task."""
        return TaskParams(
            passive_spawn_multiplier=1.0,
            melee_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            ranged_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            monsters_killed_to_clear_level=0,
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        """Generates the world for the task."""
        rng, build_rng, orc_rng = jax.random.split(rng, 3)

        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)

        builder.set_starting_floor(0)

        # Place one Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) on floor 1 near the up ladder
        up_ladder_pos = builder.ladders_up[1]  # position of the upward ladder on floor 1
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            orc_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="melee",
            type_id=2,  # Orc Soldier
            n=1,
            target_pos=up_ladder_pos,
            min_dist=1,
            max_dist=3,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH],  # walkable dungeon floor tiles
        )

        return builder.build(rng)</data>
