Relevant Achievements: FIRE_BOW, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE

Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, FIND_BOW, MAKE_ARROW

World:
- Player: Starts on floor 1 at the Ladder Up tile. Inventory: `{"sword": 1, "bow": 1, "arrows": 10}`. All stats maximum (health 9, food 9, drink 9, energy 9, mana 9). Attributes: strength=1, dexterity=1, intelligence=1.
- Map: One Orc Mage (ranged mob type_id=2) is placed using `builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(rng, 1, "ranged", 2, n=1, target_pos=player_pos, min_dist=5, max_dist=10, on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH])`. No other mobs are manually placed. All floor generation remains default.
