      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to clear the dungeon level and descend to the Gnomish Mines after crafting an iron sword.
Description: The agent starts on floor 1 (the Dungeon) with a stone pickaxe, a stone sword, 3 wood, 3 stone, and 2 coal. Two Orc Soldiers (melee, type_id=2) are placed randomly within 5–8 tiles of the player start, guaranteeing initial enemies. Two iron ore blocks are placed within 2–6 Manhattan distance of the start, on any STONE/WALL/WALL_MOSS tile. Mob spawning is tuned: melee spawn multiplier is 0.5, ranged and passive spawn multipliers are 0.0, so only occasional extra melee mobs appear. Survival needs are disabled (needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0), so food, drink, and energy remain full. The floor’s ladder‑down is unlocked after the player kills 2 hostile mobs (monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 2). The agent must first mine at least one iron ore, craft a crafting table and furnace, and forge an iron sword (MAKE_IRON_SWORD). Then it must defeat at least two enemies and descend to floor 2, granting ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES. The episode is a success only when both MAKE_IRON_SWORD and ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES are achieved.
Relevant Achievements: MAKE_IRON_SWORD, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES
Completed Achievements: MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, ENTER_DUNGEON
World:
- Player: Starts on floor 1. Inventory: `{"wood": 3, "stone": 3, "coal": 2, "pickaxe": 2, "sword": 2}` (stone pickaxe, stone sword). Achievements MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, ENTER_DUNGEON are completed.
- Map:
  - Add two Orc Soldiers (melee mob, mob_name "Orc Soldier", type_id=2) randomly within Manhattan distance 5–8 of the player start position.
  - Place 2 iron ore blocks (BlockType.IRON) randomly within Manhattan distance 2–6 of the player start, on any blocks of type STONE, WALL, or WALL_MOSS.
- Mechanics:
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0
  - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.5
  - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 2
  - All other TaskParams at default (mob_health_multiplier = 1.0, mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0, health_recover_multiplier = 1.0, health_loss_multiplier = 1.0, etc.).</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement, BlockType
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Learn to clear the dungeon level and descend to the Gnomish Mines after crafting an iron sword.
    Description: The agent starts on floor 1 (the Dungeon) with a stone pickaxe, a stone sword, 3 wood, 3 stone, and 2 coal. Two Orc Soldiers (melee, type_id=2) are placed randomly within 5–8 tiles of the player start, guaranteeing initial enemies. Two iron ore blocks are placed within 2–6 Manhattan distance of the start, on any STONE/WALL/WALL_MOSS tile. Mob spawning is tuned: melee spawn multiplier is 0.5, ranged and passive spawn multipliers are 0.0, so only occasional extra melee mobs appear. Survival needs are disabled (needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0), so food, drink, and energy remain full. The floor’s ladder‑down is unlocked after the player kills 2 hostile mobs (monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 2). The agent must first mine at least one iron ore, craft a crafting table and furnace, and forge an iron sword (MAKE_IRON_SWORD). Then it must defeat at least two enemies and descend to floor 2, granting ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES. The episode is a success only when both MAKE_IRON_SWORD and ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES are achieved.
    Relevant Achievements: MAKE_IRON_SWORD, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES
    Completed Achievements: MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, ENTER_DUNGEON
    World:
    - Player: Starts on floor 1. Inventory: `{"wood": 3, "stone": 3, "coal": 2, "pickaxe": 2, "sword": 2}` (stone pickaxe, stone sword). Achievements MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, ENTER_DUNGEON are completed.
    - Map:
      - Add two Orc Soldiers (melee mob, mob_name "Orc Soldier", type_id=2) randomly within Manhattan distance 5–8 of the player start position.
      - Place 2 iron ore blocks (BlockType.IRON) randomly within Manhattan distance 2–6 of the player start, on any blocks of type STONE, WALL, or WALL_MOSS.
    - Mechanics:
      - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0
      - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.5
      - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
      - passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
      - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 2
      - All other TaskParams at default (mob_health_multiplier = 1.0, mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0, health_recover_multiplier = 1.0, health_loss_multiplier = 1.0, etc.).
    """

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [
            Achievement.MAKE_IRON_SWORD,
            Achievement.ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES,
        ]
        self.completed_achievements = [
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_SWORD,
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE,
            Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON,
        ]
        self.label = "MAKE_IRON_SWORD, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        """Return custom parameters for this task."""
        return TaskParams(
            needs_depletion_multiplier=0.0,
            melee_spawn_multiplier=0.5,
            ranged_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            passive_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            monsters_killed_to_clear_level=2,
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        """Generates the world for the task."""
        rng, build_rng, mob_rng, ore_rng = jax.random.split(rng, 4)

        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)

        # Start on floor 1 (the Dungeon)
        builder.set_starting_floor(1)

        # Set initial inventory with stone tools and some resources
        builder.set_player_inventory(
            {"wood": 3, "stone": 3, "coal": 2, "pickaxe": 2, "sword": 2}
        )

        # Add two Orc Soldiers (melee, type_id=2) within 5-8 tiles of player start
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            mob_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="melee",
            type_id=2,  # Orc Soldier
            n=2,
            target_pos=builder.player_position,
            min_dist=5,
            max_dist=8,
        )

        # Place 2 iron ore blocks within 2-6 tiles, on stone/wall/wall_moss
        builder.place_randomly_near(
            ore_rng,
            level=1,
            block_type=BlockType.IRON,
            n=2,
            target_pos=builder.player_position,
            min_dist=2,
            max_dist=6,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.STONE, BlockType.WALL, BlockType.WALL_MOSS],
        )

        state = builder.build(rng)

        # Pre-set completed achievements
        achievements = state.achievements.at[
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_SWORD.value
        ].set(True)
        achievements = achievements.at[
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE.value
        ].set(True)
        achievements = achievements.at[
            Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON.value
        ].set(True)

        state = state.replace(achievements=achievements)
        return state</data>
