      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to clear Floor 1 (Dungeon) of multiple hostile mobs – two Orc Soldiers and one Orc Mage – in order to unlock and use the ladder down to Floor 2 (Gnomish Mines), with gentle survival pressure.

Description: The agent starts on Floor 1 (Dungeon) at the ladder‑up arrival point with an empty inventory. Survival needs are gradually re‑enabled at 30 % of normal speed (needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.3); health regenerates twice as fast (health_recover_multiplier = 2.0) to soften damage. All random mob spawns are disabled (melee/ranged/passive multipliers = 0.0). The floor‑clear requirement is reduced to 3 kills (monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 3). Three enemies are pre‑placed on Floor 1: two Orc Soldiers (melee “melee”, type_id=2) and one Orc Mage (ranged “ranged”, type_id=2), each at a random walkable PATH tile within a Manhattan distance of 5–10 from the agent’s start. The task succeeds when the agent descends to Floor 2, earning the ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES achievement. To accomplish this, the agent must ascend to the Overworld, gather wood and stone, craft a stone sword (or better) and optionally torches, descend back to Floor 1, locate and defeat all three enemies, find the now‑unlocked ladder down, and descend.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES
Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON
World:
- Player: Starting floor 1; inventory empty; all other stats default.
- Map: On Floor 1, add two Orc Soldiers and one Orc Mage using `add_mobs_randomly_near`:
    * First Orc Soldier: `builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(rng, 1, "melee", 2, 1, None, min_dist=5, max_dist=10, on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH])`
    * Second Orc Soldier: same call again.
    * Orc Mage: `builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(rng, 1, "ranged", 2, 1, None, min_dist=5, max_dist=10, on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH])`
- Mechanics: 
    "needs_depletion_multiplier": 0.3,
    "health_recover_multiplier": 2.0,
    "melee_spawn_multiplier": 0.0,
    "passive_spawn_multiplier": 0.0,
    "ranged_spawn_multiplier": 0.0,
    "monsters_killed_to_clear_level": 3</data>
