      <data key="d2">Objective: Descend from the Dungeon into the Gnomish Mines under near‑normal combat and exploration conditions, forcing the agent to locate the naturally generated ladder while fighting full‑strength orcs.

Description: The agent begins on Floor 1 (the Dungeon) at the up‑ladder spawn location, equipped with an iron sword. No extra LADDER_DOWN is placed; the agent must explore the procedurally generated dungeon rooms and corridors to find the ladder that already exists from standard world generation. To unlock descent, the agent must defeat 5 hostile monsters on this floor (melee or ranged). Mob health and damage are restored to their full default values (multipliers = 1.0). Survival needs (hunger, thirst, fatigue) deplete at 50 % of the normal rate (needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.5) to introduce modest time pressure without overwhelming the agent. This task generalises the earlier scaffolded exposure, requiring the agent to master realistic dungeon navigation and combat against Orc Soldiers and Orc Mages.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: MAKE_IRON_SWORD, ENTER_DUNGEON

World:
- Player: Set starting floor to 1 via `set_starting_floor(1)`. Inventory: `{"sword": 3}`. All other attributes remain at their defaults.
- Map: No custom block placements are applied. The default dungeon generation (rooms, corridors, ladder down) is used unchanged. The ladder down is not manually placed.
- Mechanics:
  - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 5
  - mob_health_multiplier = 1.0
  - mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.5
  - All other TaskParams (spawning multipliers, melee_trigger_distance, etc.) remain at their default values.</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement, BlockType
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Descend from the Dungeon into the Gnomish Mines under near‑normal combat and exploration conditions, forcing the agent to locate the naturally generated ladder while fighting full‑strength orcs.

    Description: The agent begins on Floor 1 (the Dungeon) at the up‑ladder spawn location, equipped with an iron sword. No extra LADDER_DOWN is placed; the agent must explore the procedurally generated dungeon rooms and corridors to find the ladder that already exists from standard world generation. To unlock descent, the agent must defeat 5 hostile monsters on this floor (melee or ranged). Mob health and damage are restored to their full default values (multipliers = 1.0). Survival needs (hunger, thirst, fatigue) deplete at 50 % of the normal rate (needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.5) to introduce modest time pressure without overwhelming the agent. This task generalises the earlier scaffolded exposure, requiring the agent to master realistic dungeon navigation and combat against Orc Soldiers and Orc Mages.

    Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

    Completed Achievements: MAKE_IRON_SWORD, ENTER_DUNGEON

    World:
    - Player: Set starting floor to 1 via `set_starting_floor(1)`. Inventory: `{"sword": 3}`. All other attributes remain at their defaults.
    - Map: No custom block placements are applied. The default dungeon generation (rooms, corridors, ladder down) is used unchanged. The ladder down is not manually placed.
    - Mechanics:
      - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 5
      - mob_health_multiplier = 1.0
      - mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0
      - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.5
      - All other TaskParams (spawning multipliers, melee_trigger_distance, etc.) remain at their default values.
    """

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [Achievement.ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES]
        self.completed_achievements = [
            Achievement.MAKE_IRON_SWORD,
            Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON,
        ]
        self.label = "ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        """Return custom parameters for this task."""
        return TaskParams(
            monsters_killed_to_clear_level=5,
            mob_health_multiplier=1.0,
            mob_damage_multiplier=1.0,
            needs_depletion_multiplier=0.5,
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        """Generates the world for the task."""
        rng, build_rng = jax.random.split(rng)

        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)

        builder.set_starting_floor(1)
        builder.set_player_inventory({"sword": 3})  # 3 = iron sword

        # No custom blocks or mobs are added; default dungeon generation is used.

        return builder.build(rng)</data>
