    <node id="task_164">
      <data key="d0">B</data>
      <data key="d1">generated</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective: Teach the agent to handle a mixed melee + ranged threat inside the Dungeon by fighting both an Orc Soldier and an Orc Mage, while still executing the full stone‑sword crafting chain.

Description:
The agent begins on floor 0 (Overworld) with an empty inventory and default stats (STR 1, DEX 1, INT 1; all needs maxed). No hostile mobs spawn anywhere (melee and ranged spawn multipliers set to 0.0), so the overworld remains completely peaceful. Standard overworld resource generation applies. The dungeon ladder on floor 0 is permanently open (0 kills required). Inside the Dungeon (floor 1), exactly two enemies are pre‑placed near the up‑ladder: one Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) and one Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2). Both are placed randomly at a Manhattan distance between 1 and 3 from the up‑ladder position, ensuring they are reachable immediately after descending but not occupying the same tile. The episode is considered successful only when the agent achieves all four goals: crafting a Stone Sword (`MAKE_STONE_SWORD`), entering the Dungeon (`ENTER_DUNGEON`), defeating the Orc Soldier (`DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER`), and defeating the Orc Mage (`DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE`). This forces the agent to manage two distinct threat types with only a stone sword, teaching threat prioritisation and melee‑kiting hybrid tactics.

Relevant Achievements: MAKE_STONE_SWORD, ENTER_DUNGEON, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE
Completed Achievements: (none)
World:
- Player: Start on floor 0. Inventory empty. Stats default (1/1/1). All status bars full.
- Map:
  - Floor 0: unchanged (standard generation).
  - Floor 1: add one Orc Soldier (`mob_name="melee"`, `type_id=2`) and one Orc Mage (`mob_name="ranged"`, `type_id=2`), each randomly placed within Manhattan distance 1–3 from the up‑ladder position. Ensure the two mobs are placed on distinct, non‑colliding tiles.
- Mechanics:
  - `passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0` (keep passive spawns as normal, though no passive mobs are used)
  - `melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0` (no further melee mobs spawn on any floor)
  - `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0` (no further ranged mobs spawn on any floor)
  - `monsters_killed_to_clear_level` for floor 0 set to 0
  - All other `TaskParams` at default.</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement, BlockType
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Teach the agent to handle a mixed melee + ranged threat inside the Dungeon by fighting both an Orc Soldier and an Orc Mage, while still executing the full stone‑sword crafting chain.

    Description:
    The agent begins on floor 0 (Overworld) with an empty inventory and default stats (STR 1, DEX 1, INT 1; all needs maxed). No hostile mobs spawn anywhere (melee and ranged spawn multipliers set to 0.0), so the overworld remains completely peaceful. Standard overworld resource generation applies. The dungeon ladder on floor 0 is permanently open (0 kills required). Inside the Dungeon (floor 1), exactly two enemies are pre‑placed near the up‑ladder: one Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) and one Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2). Both are placed randomly at a Manhattan distance between 1 and 3 from the up‑ladder position, ensuring they are reachable immediately after descending but not occupying the same tile. The episode is considered successful only when the agent achieves all four goals: crafting a Stone Sword (`MAKE_STONE_SWORD`), entering the Dungeon (`ENTER_DUNGEON`), defeating the Orc Soldier (`DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER`), and defeating the Orc Mage (`DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE`). This forces the agent to manage two distinct threat types with only a stone sword, teaching threat prioritisation and melee‑kiting hybrid tactics.

    Relevant Achievements: MAKE_STONE_SWORD, ENTER_DUNGEON, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE
    Completed Achievements: (none)
    World:
    - Player: Start on floor 0. Inventory empty. Stats default (1/1/1). All status bars full.
    - Map:
      - Floor 0: unchanged (standard generation).
      - Floor 1: add one Orc Soldier (`mob_name="melee"`, `type_id=2`) and one Orc Mage (`mob_name="ranged"`, `type_id=2`), each randomly placed within Manhattan distance 1–3 from the up‑ladder position. Ensure the two mobs are placed on distinct, non‑colliding tiles.
    - Mechanics:
      - `passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0` (keep passive spawns as normal, though no passive mobs are used)
      - `melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0` (no further melee mobs spawn on any floor)
      - `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0` (no further ranged mobs spawn on any floor)
      - `monsters_killed_to_clear_level` for floor 0 set to 0
      - All other `TaskParams` at default.
    """

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_SWORD,
            Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON,
            Achievement.DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER,
            Achievement.DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE,
        ]
        self.completed_achievements = []
        self.label = "MAKE_STONE_SWORD, ENTER_DUNGEON, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        """Return custom parameters for this task."""
        return TaskParams(
            passive_spawn_multiplier=1.0,      # default passive spawns
            melee_spawn_multiplier=0.0,        # disable random melee spawns
            ranged_spawn_multiplier=0.0,       # disable random ranged spawns
            monsters_killed_to_clear_level=0,  # ladder permanently open on every floor
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        """Generates the world for the task."""
        rng, build_rng, melee_rng, ranged_rng = jax.random.split(rng, 4)

        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)

        builder.set_starting_floor(0)

        # The up‑ladder on floor 1 is where the player arrives when descending
        up_ladder_pos = builder.ladders_up[1]

        # Place one Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) within Manhattan distance 1–3
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            melee_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="melee",
            type_id=2,
            n=1,
            target_pos=up_ladder_pos,
            min_dist=1,
            max_dist=3,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH, BlockType.GRASS, BlockType.FIRE_GRASS, BlockType.ICE_GRASS, BlockType.SAND],
        )

        # Place one Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2) within Manhattan distance 1–3
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            ranged_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="ranged",
            type_id=2,
            n=1,
            target_pos=up_ladder_pos,
            min_dist=1,
            max_dist=3,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH, BlockType.GRASS, BlockType.FIRE_GRASS, BlockType.ICE_GRASS, BlockType.SAND],
        )

        return builder.build(rng)</data>
