      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to defeat one Orc Soldier and one Orc Mage on the dungeon floor (floor 1) using provided iron gear and ranged attacks, without any other spawning threats.

Description: The agent starts on dungeon floor 1 at the ladder‑up position. It is equipped with an iron sword (level 3), a bow, 20 arrows, and one piece of iron armour (defence +1). All needs start full. A single Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) and a single Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2) spawn on the level within Manhattan distance 3–10 of the player’s start position. No further mobs can spawn (melee_spawn_multiplier=0, ranged_spawn_multiplier=0), so the only threats are these two enemies. The agent must locate and kill both orcs using its weapons and armour. The episode succeeds when both DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER and DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE achievements are obtained.

Relevant Achievements: DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE

Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, COLLECT_STONE, COLLECT_COAL, COLLECT_IRON, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_ARMOUR, PLACE_FURNACE, ENTER_DUNGEON, FIND_BOW, MAKE_ARROW, FIRE_BOW

World:
- Player: Start on floor 1 (set_starting_floor(1)). Inventory: sword=3, bow=1, arrows=20, armour=1; all status bars (health, food, drink, energy, mana) at max.
- Map:
  - Add 1 Orc Soldier melee mob (mob_name = "orc_soldier", type_id = 2) randomly on level 1 on tiles of type BlockType.PATH, with target_pos=None (player start), min_dist=3, max_dist=10.
  - Add 1 Orc Mage ranged mob (mob_name = "orc_mage", type_id = 2) randomly on level 1 on tiles of type BlockType.PATH, with target_pos=None, min_dist=3, max_dist=10.
- Mechanics:
  - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0
  - All other TaskParams at default values.</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
import jax.numpy as jnp
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement, BlockType
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Learn to defeat one Orc Soldier and one Orc Mage on the dungeon floor (floor 1) using provided iron gear and ranged attacks, without any other spawning threats.

    Description: The agent starts on dungeon floor 1 at the ladder‑up position. It is equipped with an iron sword (level 3), a bow, 20 arrows, and one piece of iron armour (defence +1). All needs start full. A single Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) and a single Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2) spawn on the level within Manhattan distance 3–10 of the player’s start position. No further mobs can spawn (melee_spawn_multiplier=0, ranged_spawn_multiplier=0), so the only threats are these two enemies. The agent must locate and kill both orcs using its weapons and armour. The episode succeeds when both DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER and DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE achievements are obtained.

    Relevant Achievements: DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE

    Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, COLLECT_STONE, COLLECT_COAL, COLLECT_IRON, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_ARMOUR, PLACE_FURNACE, ENTER_DUNGEON, FIND_BOW, MAKE_ARROW, FIRE_BOW

    World:
    - Player: Start on floor 1 (set_starting_floor(1)). Inventory: sword=3, bow=1, arrows=20, armour=1; all status bars (health, food, drink, energy, mana) at max.
    - Map:
      - Add 1 Orc Soldier melee mob (mob_name = "melee", type_id = 2) randomly on level 1 on tiles of type BlockType.PATH, with target_pos=None (player start), min_dist=3, max_dist=10.
      - Add 1 Orc Mage ranged mob (mob_name = "ranged", type_id = 2) randomly on level 1 on tiles of type BlockType.PATH, with target_pos=None, min_dist=3, max_dist=10.
    - Mechanics:
      - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
      - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
      - passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
      - needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0
      - All other TaskParams at default values.
    """

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [
            Achievement.DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER,
            Achievement.DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE,
        ]
        self.completed_achievements = [
            Achievement.COLLECT_WOOD,
            Achievement.PLACE_TABLE,
            Achievement.COLLECT_STONE,
            Achievement.COLLECT_COAL,
            Achievement.COLLECT_IRON,
            Achievement.MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE,
            Achievement.MAKE_WOOD_SWORD,
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE,
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_SWORD,
            Achievement.MAKE_IRON_SWORD,
            Achievement.MAKE_IRON_ARMOUR,
            Achievement.PLACE_FURNACE,
            Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON,
            Achievement.FIND_BOW,
            Achievement.MAKE_ARROW,
            Achievement.FIRE_BOW,
        ]
        self.label = "DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        """Return custom parameters for this task."""
        return TaskParams(
            melee_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            ranged_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            passive_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            needs_depletion_multiplier=1.0,
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        """Generates the world for the task."""
        rng, build_rng = jax.random.split(rng)
        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)

        builder.set_starting_floor(1)
        builder.set_player_inventory({
            "sword": 3,          # iron sword
            "bow": 1,            # bow
            "arrows": 20,        # 20 arrows
            "armour": jnp.array([1, 0, 0, 0]),  # one piece of iron armour (helmet)
        })

        rng, melee_rng, ranged_rng = jax.random.split(rng, 3)

        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            melee_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="melee",
            type_id=2,    # Orc Soldier
            n=1,
            target_pos=None,      # defaults to player_position
            min_dist=3,
            max_dist=10,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH],
        )

        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            ranged_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="ranged",
            type_id=2,    # Orc Mage
            n=1,
            target_pos=None,
            min_dist=3,
            max_dist=10,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH],
        )

        return builder.build(rng)</data>
