      <data key="d1">generated</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to craft an iron sword and defeat both an Orc Soldier and an Orc Mage in the dungeon.
Description: The agent starts on floor 1 (the dungeon) with a stone pickaxe, a stone sword, and small stacks of wood (3), stone (3), and coal (2). All mob spawning is disabled (multipliers set to 0.0) and survival needs are turned off (needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0), so the agent stays fully fed, hydrated, and rested. Two iron ore blocks are placed within 2–6 Manhattan distance of the player start on any STONE, WALL, or WALL_MOSS block. One Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) and one Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2) are placed randomly within 5–10 Manhattan distance of the start, ensuring both are reachable without long exploration. The agent must mine at least one iron block, use the initial resources to place a crafting table and furnace, craft an iron sword, and then defeat both the Orc Soldier and the Orc Mage. The episode succeeds only when MAKE_IRON_SWORD, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, and DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE are all achieved.
Relevant Achievements: MAKE_IRON_SWORD, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE
Completed Achievements: MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, ENTER_DUNGEON
World:
- Player: Starts on floor 1. Inventory: `{"wood": 3, "stone": 3, "coal": 2, "pickaxe": 2, "sword": 2}` (stone pickaxe, stone sword). Achievements MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, ENTER_DUNGEON completed.
- Map:
  - Place 2 iron ore blocks (BlockType.IRON) randomly within 2–6 Manhattan distance of the player start position, on any blocks of type STONE, WALL, or WALL_MOSS.
  - Add exactly one Orc Soldier (melee mob, mob_name "Orc Soldier", type_id=2) randomly within 5–10 Manhattan distance of the player start.
  - Add exactly one Orc Mage (ranged mob, mob_name "Orc Mage", type_id=2) randomly within 5–10 Manhattan distance of the player start.
  - No other initial mobs, no other block modifications.
- Mechanics:
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0
  - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - All other TaskParams remain at their defaults (mob_health_multiplier = 1.0, mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0, health_recover_multiplier = 1.0, health_loss_multiplier = 1.0, etc.).</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement, BlockType
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Learn to craft an iron sword and defeat both an Orc Soldier and an Orc Mage in the dungeon.
    Description: The agent starts on floor 1 (the dungeon) with a stone pickaxe, a stone sword, and small stacks of wood (3), stone (3), and coal (2). All mob spawning is disabled (multipliers set to 0.0) and survival needs are turned off (needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0), so the agent stays fully fed, hydrated, and rested. Two iron ore blocks are placed within 2–6 Manhattan distance of the player start on any STONE, WALL, or WALL_MOSS block. One Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) and one Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2) are placed randomly within 5–10 Manhattan distance of the start, ensuring both are reachable without long exploration. The agent must mine at least one iron block, use the initial resources to place a crafting table and furnace, craft an iron sword, and then defeat both the Orc Soldier and the Orc Mage. The episode succeeds only when MAKE_IRON_SWORD, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, and DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE are all achieved.
    Relevant Achievements: MAKE_IRON_SWORD, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE
    Completed Achievements: MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, ENTER_DUNGEON
    World:
    - Player: Starts on floor 1. Inventory: `{"wood": 3, "stone": 3, "coal": 2, "pickaxe": 2, "sword": 2}` (stone pickaxe, stone sword). Achievements MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, ENTER_DUNGEON completed.
    - Map:
      - Place 2 iron ore blocks (BlockType.IRON) randomly within 2–6 Manhattan distance of the player start position, on any blocks of type STONE, WALL, or WALL_MOSS.
      - Add exactly one Orc Soldier (melee mob, mob_name "Orc Soldier", type_id=2) randomly within 5–10 Manhattan distance of the player start.
      - Add exactly one Orc Mage (ranged mob, mob_name "Orc Mage", type_id=2) randomly within 5–10 Manhattan distance of the player start.
      - No other initial mobs, no other block modifications.
    - Mechanics:
      - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0
      - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
      - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
      - passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
      - All other TaskParams remain at their defaults (mob_health_multiplier = 1.0, mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0, health_recover_multiplier = 1.0, health_loss_multiplier = 1.0, etc.).
    """

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [
            Achievement.MAKE_IRON_SWORD,
            Achievement.DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER,
            Achievement.DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE,
        ]
        self.completed_achievements = [
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_SWORD,
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE,
            Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON,
        ]
        self.label = "MAKE_IRON_SWORD, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        """Return custom parameters for this task."""
        return TaskParams(
            needs_depletion_multiplier=0.0,   # needs off
            melee_spawn_multiplier=0.0,       # no melee spawns
            ranged_spawn_multiplier=0.0,      # no ranged spawns
            passive_spawn_multiplier=0.0,     # no passive spawns
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        """Generates the world for the task."""
        rng, build_rng, iron_rng, orc_soldier_rng, orc_mage_rng = jax.random.split(rng, 5)

        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)

        # Start on floor 1 (dungeon)
        builder.set_starting_floor(1)

        # Give the prerequisite inventory
        builder.set_player_inventory({
            "wood": 3,
            "stone": 3,
            "coal": 2,
            "pickaxe": 2,   # stone pickaxe
            "sword": 2,     # stone sword
        })

        # Place 2 iron ore blocks near the player on floor 1, on STONE/WALL/WALL_MOSS
        builder.place_randomly_near(
            iron_rng,
            level=1,
            block_type=BlockType.IRON,
            target_pos=builder.player_position,
            min_dist=2,
            max_dist=6,
            n=2,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.STONE, BlockType.WALL, BlockType.WALL_MOSS],
        )

        # Place one Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) 5-10 tiles away
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            orc_soldier_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="melee",
            type_id=2,      # Orc Soldier
            n=1,
            target_pos=builder.player_position,
            min_dist=5,
            max_dist=10,
        )

        # Place one Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2) 5-10 tiles away
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            orc_mage_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="ranged",
            type_id=2,      # Orc Mage
            n=1,
            target_pos=builder.player_position,
            min_dist=5,
            max_dist=10,
        )

        return builder.build(rng)</data>
