    <node id="task_191">
      <data key="d0">B</data>
      <data key="d1">generated</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to clear the dungeon level and descend to the Gnomish Mines (floor 2) by defeating a required number of enemies and using the DESCEND action.

Description: The agent begins on floor 1 (the Dungeon) with an iron sword, stone pickaxe, bow, 10 arrows, 5 torches, 3 wood, and 3 stone. All hostile mob spawning is disabled (melee, ranged, passive multipliers = 0.0), and survival needs are frozen (needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0) so health and food remain full. The only enemies present are three Orc Soldiers (melee mob, mob_name "Orc Soldier", type_id=2) and two Orc Mages (ranged mob, mob_name "Orc Mage", type_id=2) placed randomly within 5–10 Manhattan distance of the player start. The ladder down to floor 2 exists somewhere in the dungeon (generated normally). The clear requirement for the floor is reduced to `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 3`. The task ends successfully when the agent first descends to the Gnomish Mines (achievement ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES). The agent may engage enemies in any order; each kill counts toward the floor clear, and achieving at least 3 kills will unlock the ladder down, after which stepping onto a ladder_down tile and executing DESCEND triggers floor transition.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_IRON_SWORD, FIND_BOW

World:
- Player: Starts on floor 1. Inventory: `{"iron_sword": 1, "stone_pickaxe": 1, "bow": 1, "arrows": 10, "torches": 5, "wood": 3, "stone": 3}`. Achievements ENTER_DUNGEON, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_IRON_SWORD, FIND_BOW are completed.
- Map:
  - Place 3 Orc Soldier melee mobs (mob_name "Orc Soldier", type_id=2) randomly within 5–10 Manhattan distance of the player start position, on any passable ground (any non‑solid block).
  - Place 2 Orc Mage ranged mobs (mob_name "Orc Mage", type_id=2) randomly within 5–10 Manhattan distance of the player start, similarly on passable ground.
  - No other initial mobs or block modifications.
- Mechanics:
  - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 3
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0
  - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - mob_health_multiplier = 1.0
  - mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0
  - health_recover_multiplier = 1.0
  - health_loss_multiplier = 1.0
  - mana_recover_multiplier = 1.0</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement, BlockType
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Learn to clear the dungeon level and descend to the Gnomish Mines (floor 2) by defeating a required number of enemies and using the DESCEND action.

    Description: The agent begins on floor 1 (the Dungeon) with an iron sword, stone pickaxe, bow, 10 arrows, 5 torches, 3 wood, and 3 stone. All hostile mob spawning is disabled (melee, ranged, passive multipliers = 0.0), and survival needs are frozen (needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0) so health and food remain full. The only enemies present are three Orc Soldiers (melee mob, mob_name "Orc Soldier", type_id=2) and two Orc Mages (ranged mob, mob_name "Orc Mage", type_id=2) placed randomly within 5–10 Manhattan distance of the player start. The ladder down to floor 2 exists somewhere in the dungeon (generated normally). The clear requirement for the floor is reduced to `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 3`. The task ends successfully when the agent first descends to the Gnomish Mines (achievement ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES). The agent may engage enemies in any order; each kill counts toward the floor clear, and achieving at least 3 kills will unlock the ladder down, after which stepping onto a ladder_down tile and executing DESCEND triggers floor transition.

    Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

    Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_IRON_SWORD, FIND_BOW

    World:
    - Player: Starts on floor 1. Inventory: `{"iron_sword": 1, "stone_pickaxe": 1, "bow": 1, "arrows": 10, "torches": 5, "wood": 3, "stone": 3}`. Achievements ENTER_DUNGEON, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_IRON_SWORD, FIND_BOW are completed.
    - Map:
      - Place 3 Orc Soldier melee mobs (mob_name "Orc Soldier", type_id=2) randomly within 5–10 Manhattan distance of the player start position, on any passable ground (any non‑solid block).
      - Place 2 Orc Mage ranged mobs (mob_name "Orc Mage", type_id=2) randomly within 5–10 Manhattan distance of the player start, similarly on passable ground.
      - No other initial mobs or block modifications.
    - Mechanics:
      - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 3
      - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0
      - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
      - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
      - passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
      - mob_health_multiplier = 1.0
      - mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0
      - health_recover_multiplier = 1.0
      - health_loss_multiplier = 1.0
      - mana_recover_multiplier = 1.0
    """

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [Achievement.ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES]
        self.completed_achievements = [
            Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON,
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE,
            Achievement.MAKE_IRON_SWORD,
            Achievement.FIND_BOW,
        ]
        self.label = "ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        """Return custom parameters for this task."""
        return TaskParams(
            melee_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            ranged_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            passive_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            needs_depletion_multiplier=0.0,
            monsters_killed_to_clear_level=3,
            mob_health_multiplier=1.0,
            mob_damage_multiplier=1.0,
            health_recover_multiplier=1.0,
            health_loss_multiplier=1.0,
            mana_recover_multiplier=1.0,
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        """Generates the world for the task."""
        rng, build_rng, melee_rng, ranged_rng = jax.random.split(rng, 4)

        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)

        builder.set_starting_floor(1)
        builder.set_player_inventory({
            "sword": 3,         # iron sword
            "pickaxe": 2,       # stone pickaxe
            "bow": 1,
            "arrows": 10,
            "torches": 5,
            "wood": 3,
            "stone": 3,
        })

        # Place 3 Orc Soldiers (melee, type_id=2) near the player
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            melee_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="melee",
            type_id=2,
            n=3,
            target_pos=builder.player_position,
            min_dist=5,
            max_dist=10,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH],  # passable tiles in dungeon
        )

        # Place 2 Orc Mages (ranged, type_id=2) near the player
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            ranged_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="ranged",
            type_id=2,
            n=2,
            target_pos=builder.player_position,
            min_dist=5,
            max_dist=10,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH],
        )

        return builder.build(rng)</data>
