      <data key="d1">generated</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to clear the dungeon floor (defeat the two placed orcs) and then descend to the Gnomish Mines using the ladder.

Description: The agent begins on dungeon floor 1 at the ladder-up position. It is equipped with an iron sword (level 3), a bow, 20 arrows, and one piece of iron armour (defence +1). All needs (health, food, drink, energy, mana) start full. A single Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) and a single Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2) are placed on the level at random positions on PATH tiles, within Manhattan distance 3–10 of the player start. No further mobs can spawn (all spawn multipliers set to 0.0), so the only threats are these two enemies. The floor‑clear requirement is set to 2: the ladder down is locked until the agent has killed two hostile mobs (i.e., both orcs). After defeating both, the agent must navigate to the ladder‑down block, stand on it, and perform the DESCEND action. Descending to floor 2 for the first time triggers the ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES achievement, which signals task success. The episode fails if the agent dies or runs out of time without reaching floor 2.

Relevant Achievements: DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, COLLECT_STONE, COLLECT_COAL, COLLECT_IRON, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_ARMOUR, PLACE_FURNACE, ENTER_DUNGEON, FIND_BOW, MAKE_ARROW, FIRE_BOW

World:
- Player: Start on floor 1 (set_starting_floor(1)). Inventory: sword=3, bow=1, arrows=20, armour=1; status bars at max.
- Map:
  - Add 1 Orc Soldier melee mob (mob_name = "orc_soldier", type_id = 2) randomly on level 1 on tiles of type BlockType.PATH, with target_pos=None (player start), min_dist=3, max_dist=10.
  - Add 1 Orc Mage ranged mob (mob_name = "orc_mage", type_id = 2) randomly on level 1 on tiles of type BlockType.PATH, with target_pos=None, min_dist=3, max_dist=10.
- Mechanics:
  - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 2
  - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0
  - All other TaskParams at default values.</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
import jax.numpy as jnp
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement, BlockType
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Learn to clear the dungeon floor (defeat the two placed orcs) and then descend to the Gnomish Mines using the ladder.

    Description: The agent begins on dungeon floor 1 at the ladder-up position. It is equipped with an iron sword (level 3), a bow, 20 arrows, and one piece of iron armour (defence +1). All needs (health, food, drink, energy, mana) start full. A single Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) and a single Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2) are placed on the level at random positions on PATH tiles, within Manhattan distance 3–10 of the player start. No further mobs can spawn (all spawn multipliers set to 0.0), so the only threats are these two enemies. The floor‑clear requirement is set to 2: the ladder down is locked until the agent has killed two hostile mobs (i.e., both orcs). After defeating both, the agent must navigate to the ladder‑down block, stand on it, and perform the DESCEND action. Descending to floor 2 for the first time triggers the ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES achievement, which signals task success. The episode fails if the agent dies or runs out of time without reaching floor 2.

    Relevant Achievements: DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

    Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, COLLECT_STONE, COLLECT_COAL, COLLECT_IRON, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_ARMOUR, PLACE_FURNACE, ENTER_DUNGEON, FIND_BOW, MAKE_ARROW, FIRE_BOW

    World:
    - Player: Start on floor 1 (set_starting_floor(1)). Inventory: sword=3, bow=1, arrows=20, armour=1; status bars at max.
    - Map:
      - Add 1 Orc Soldier melee mob (mob_name = "orc_soldier", type_id = 2) randomly on level 1 on tiles of type BlockType.PATH, with target_pos=None (player start), min_dist=3, max_dist=10.
      - Add 1 Orc Mage ranged mob (mob_name = "orc_mage", type_id = 2) randomly on level 1 on tiles of type BlockType.PATH, with target_pos=None, min_dist=3, max_dist=10.
    - Mechanics:
      - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 2
      - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
      - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
      - passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
      - needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0
      - All other TaskParams at default values.
    """

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [
            Achievement.DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER,
            Achievement.DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE,
            Achievement.ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES,
        ]
        self.completed_achievements = [
            Achievement.COLLECT_WOOD,
            Achievement.PLACE_TABLE,
            Achievement.COLLECT_STONE,
            Achievement.COLLECT_COAL,
            Achievement.COLLECT_IRON,
            Achievement.MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE,
            Achievement.MAKE_WOOD_SWORD,
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE,
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_SWORD,
            Achievement.MAKE_IRON_SWORD,
            Achievement.MAKE_IRON_ARMOUR,
            Achievement.PLACE_FURNACE,
            Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON,
            Achievement.FIND_BOW,
            Achievement.MAKE_ARROW,
            Achievement.FIRE_BOW,
        ]
        self.label = "DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        """Return custom parameters for this task."""
        return TaskParams(
            melee_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            ranged_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            passive_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            needs_depletion_multiplier=1.0,
            monsters_killed_to_clear_level=2,
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        """Generates the world for the task."""
        rng, build_rng, orc_melee_rng, orc_ranged_rng = jax.random.split(rng, 4)

        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)

        # Start on dungeon floor 1
        builder.set_starting_floor(1)

        # Equip player with iron sword (3), bow, arrows, and one piece of iron armour
        builder.set_player_inventory({
            "sword": 3,
            "bow": 1,
            "arrows": 20,
            "armour": jnp.array([0, 1, 0, 0]),  # chestplate = iron (tier 1)
        })

        # Place an Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) 3‑10 tiles away on PATH blocks
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            orc_melee_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="melee",
            type_id=2,
            n=1,
            target_pos=builder.player_position,
            min_dist=3,
            max_dist=10,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH],
        )

        # Place an Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2) 3‑10 tiles away on PATH blocks
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            orc_ranged_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="ranged",
            type_id=2,
            n=1,
            target_pos=builder.player_position,
            min_dist=3,
            max_dist=10,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH],
        )

        return builder.build(rng)</data>
