    <node id="task_206">
      <data key="d0">B</data>
      <data key="d1">generated</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective: Descend to the Gnomish Mines after clearing the Dungeon level.
Description: The agent starts on floor 1 (the Dungeon) with a stone sword (tier 2). Hostile melee mobs (Orc Soldiers) and ranged mobs (Orc Mages) spawn at half the default rate (`melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.5`, `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.5`). Passive mobs (Snails) spawn normally (`passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`). The level‑clear threshold is reduced to 3 kills (`monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 3`), so the agent must defeat at least 3 hostile mobs to unlock the Ladder Down. The episode succeeds when the agent finds any Ladder Down tile on floor 1 and uses the Descend action, earning the `ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES` achievement. Survival needs, health/mana regeneration, and all other mechanics remain at default values. The task compresses pre‑dungeon crafting and exploration; the agent is dropped directly into the dungeon with the required weapon.
Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES
Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, MAKE_STONE_SWORD
World:
- Player: Starts on floor 1 with inventory `{"sword": 2}` (stone sword). All attributes default (STR 1, DEX 1, INT 1); health, food, drink, energy, mana start at 9/9.
- Map: None. Use default dungeon generation — Ladder Down appears in a normal dungeon room according to the standard placement rules.
- Mechanics: `passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`, `melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.5`, `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.5`, `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 3`. All other `TaskParams` at their default values (e.g., `melee_trigger_distance = 10`, `needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0`).</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Descend to the Gnomish Mines after clearing the Dungeon level.
    Description: The agent starts on floor 1 (the Dungeon) with a stone sword (tier 2). Hostile melee mobs (Orc Soldiers) and ranged mobs (Orc Mages) spawn at half the default rate (`melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.5`, `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.5`). Passive mobs (Snails) spawn normally (`passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`). The level‑clear threshold is reduced to 3 kills (`monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 3`), so the agent must defeat at least 3 hostile mobs to unlock the Ladder Down. The episode succeeds when the agent finds any Ladder Down tile on floor 1 and uses the Descend action, earning the `ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES` achievement. Survival needs, health/mana regeneration, and all other mechanics remain at default values. The task compresses pre‑dungeon crafting and exploration; the agent is dropped directly into the dungeon with the required weapon.
    Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES
    Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, MAKE_STONE_SWORD
    World:
    - Player: Starts on floor 1 with inventory `{"sword": 2}` (stone sword). All attributes default (STR 1, DEX 1, INT 1); health, food, drink, energy, mana start at 9/9.
    - Map: None. Use default dungeon generation — Ladder Down appears in a normal dungeon room according to the standard placement rules.
    - Mechanics: `passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`, `melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.5`, `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.5`, `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 3`. All other `TaskParams` at their default values (e.g., `melee_trigger_distance = 10`, `needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0`).
    """

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [Achievement.ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES]
        self.completed_achievements = [
            Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON,
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_SWORD,
        ]
        self.label = "ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        return TaskParams(
            passive_spawn_multiplier=1.0,
            melee_spawn_multiplier=0.5,
            ranged_spawn_multiplier=0.5,
            monsters_killed_to_clear_level=3,
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        rng, build_rng = jax.random.split(rng)
        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)
        builder.set_starting_floor(1)
        builder.set_player_inventory({"sword": 2})
        return builder.build(rng)</data>
