Relevant Achievements: DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, EAT_COW?, wait no, we didn't include that. I'll only include the ones that are needed for the iron gear and bow. From the parent: COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, COLLECT_STONE, COLLECT_COAL, COLLECT_IRON, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_ARMOUR, PLACE_FURNACE, ENTER_DUNGEON, FIND_BOW, MAKE_ARROW, FIRE_BOW. I'll copy those. I'll also include any basic survival achievements? The parent didn't include WAKE_UP, EAT_COW, COLLECT_DRINK, etc., because they aren't accomplished by the starting state (the agent might not have those items). Actually, we should only include achievements that are implicitly satisfied by the initial state inventory, which doesn't give food/drink. So those are not completed. So the list is as above.

