- Player: Start on floor 1 (set_starting_floor(1)). Inventory: {"sword": 3, "bow": 1, "arrows": 20, "armour": 1}. All stats at max.
- Map: No manual block or mob placements; the normal dungeon generation (rooms, corridors, chests, fountains) is left unchanged. We rely on the spawn system to produce the orcs.

- Mechanics:
