      <data key="d2">Objective: Defeat an Orc Soldier and an Orc Mage simultaneously at full damage, bridging from scaffolded half-damage combat to real-game dungeon difficulty.

Description: The player starts in the Dungeon (Floor 1) at the Ladder Up position, possessing a wooden sword, a bow, and 10 arrows. One Orc Soldier (melee mob, `mob_name="melee"`, `type_id=2`) and one Orc Mage (ranged mob, `mob_name="ranged"`, `type_id=2`) are pre-placed near the player's start location. Both are placed using `add_mobs_randomly_near` with `target_pos` set to the player's starting tile, `min_dist=5`, `max_dist=10`, and `on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH]`. No other mobs are manually placed, and all spawn multipliers are set to zero, so only these two hostiles exist. Mob damage is set to normal (`mob_damage_multiplier=1.0`), matching the full game. The task is to fire the bow at least once (triggering `FIRE_BOW`) and then kill both the Orc Soldier and the Orc Mage, unlocking `DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER` and `DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE`. The episode ends as soon as all three relevant achievements have been earned.

Relevant Achievements: FIRE_BOW, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE

Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, FIND_BOW, MAKE_ARROW

World:
