      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to clear a Dungeon floor of multiple Orc Soldiers to unlock the ladder and descend to the Gnomish Mines, building multi‑enemy combat and exploration skills.

Description: The player spawns in the Dungeon (Floor 1) at the Ladder Up position. Their inventory contains a wood sword, a bow, and 10 arrows. Three Orc Soldiers (melee, type_id=2) are pre‑placed on the floor using random placement near the player. All mob spawn multipliers are set to zero, so no additional enemies appear. The floor‑clear requirement is set to 3, meaning the ladder down becomes usable only after all three Orc Soldiers are defeated. To succeed, the agent must explore the dungeon, engage and kill each soldier using melee or ranged attacks, then locate the Ladder Down tile and execute the DESCEND action. The episode ends successfully when ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES is achieved. The player begins with full health (9), food (9), drink (9), energy (9), and mana (9), and standard attributes (strength=1, dexterity=1, intelligence=1). Survival needs decay at the normal rate.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES
Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, FIND_BOW, MAKE_ARROW, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD

World:
- Player: Starts on floor 1 at the ladder‑up tile. Inventory: `{"sword": 1, "bow": 1, "arrows": 10}`. All stats maximum.
- Map: Three Orc Soldiers placed using `builder.add_mobs_randomly_near`:
    `builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(rng, 1, "melee", 2, n=3, target_pos=player_pos, min_dist=5, max_dist=20, on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH])`
  No other mobs pre‑placed. Floor generation remains default (rooms, corridors, chests, fountains, ladders).
- Mechanics:
    `passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`
    `melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`
    `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`
    `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 3`  (applies to all floors; only floor 1 matters)
  All other TaskParams retain default values (e.g., `needs_depletion_multiplier=1.0`, `health_recover_multiplier=1.0`).</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement, BlockType
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Learn to clear a Dungeon floor of multiple Orc Soldiers to unlock the ladder and descend to the Gnomish Mines, building multi‑enemy combat and exploration skills.

Description: The player spawns in the Dungeon (Floor 1) at the Ladder Up position. Their inventory contains a wood sword, a bow, and 10 arrows. Three Orc Soldiers (melee, type_id=2) are pre‑placed on the floor using random placement near the player. All mob spawn multipliers are set to zero, so no additional enemies appear. The floor‑clear requirement is set to 3, meaning the ladder down becomes usable only after all three Orc Soldiers are defeated. To succeed, the agent must explore the dungeon, engage and kill each soldier using melee or ranged attacks, then locate the Ladder Down tile and execute the DESCEND action. The episode ends successfully when ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES is achieved. The player begins with full health (9), food (9), drink (9), energy (9), and mana (9), and standard attributes (strength=1, dexterity=1, intelligence=1). Survival needs decay at the normal rate.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES
Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, FIND_BOW, MAKE_ARROW, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD

World:
- Player: Starts on floor 1 at the ladder‑up tile. Inventory: `{"sword": 1, "bow": 1, "arrows": 10}`. All stats maximum.
- Map: Three Orc Soldiers placed using `builder.add_mobs_randomly_near`:
    `builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(rng, 1, "melee", 2, n=3, target_pos=player_pos, min_dist=5, max_dist=20, on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH])`
  No other mobs pre‑placed. Floor generation remains default (rooms, corridors, chests, fountains, ladders).
- Mechanics:
    `passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`
    `melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`
    `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`
    `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 3`  (applies to all floors; only floor 1 matters)
  All other TaskParams retain default values (e.g., `needs_depletion_multiplier=1.0`, `health_recover_multiplier=1.0`).
    """

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [Achievement.ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES]
        self.completed_achievements = [
            Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON,
            Achievement.FIND_BOW,
            Achievement.MAKE_ARROW,
            Achievement.MAKE_WOOD_SWORD,
        ]
        self.label = "ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        """Return custom parameters for this task."""
        return TaskParams(
            passive_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            melee_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            ranged_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            monsters_killed_to_clear_level=3,
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        """Generates the world for the task."""
        rng, build_rng, mob_rng = jax.random.split(rng, 3)

        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)

        builder.set_starting_floor(1)
        player_pos = builder.player_position  # after setting starting floor

        builder.set_player_inventory({"sword": 1, "bow": 1, "arrows": 10})

        # Place 3 Orc Soldiers near the player on floor 1
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            mob_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="melee",
            type_id=2,  # Orc Soldier
            n=3,
            target_pos=player_pos,
            min_dist=5,
            max_dist=20,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH],
        )

        return builder.build(rng)</data>
