      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to efficiently explore the entire overworld to find and mine 3 iron ore and 3 coal ore from natural generation, then craft iron armour.

Description: The agent starts on floor 0 at the default spawn position with a stone pickaxe (level 2), a stone sword, and no other resources. A crafting table and a furnace are already placed directly adjacent to the player (one tile north and one tile south, respectively). All other world generation follows the default procedural rules – in particular, iron and coal ores are spawned only by the natural 2% and 3% probabilities on stone blocks, without any additional guaranteed placements. The agent must explore the entire overworld to locate at least 3 iron ore and 3 coal ore, mine them (using the stone pickaxe), and then use the ready‑made workstations to craft an iron armour piece. Survival needs are reduced to 50% of the normal rate (needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.5) to give the agent more time to search without dying from hunger or thirst. All other game mechanics (combat, mob spawning, health/mana) remain at default values. The episode ends successfully once the iron armour is crafted.

Relevant Achievements: MAKE_IRON_ARMOUR

Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, COLLECT_STONE, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, PLACE_FURNACE

World:
- Player: Starts on floor 0 at the natural overworld spawn point. Inventory contains: stone pickaxe (1), stone sword (1).
- Map:
  - Use place_block to add a CRAFTING_TABLE at the tile immediately north of the player’s starting position (player.row - 1, player.col).
  - Use place_block to add a FURNACE at the tile immediately south of the player’s starting position (player.row + 1, player.col).
  - No other block modifications are made; all terrain and ore generation remains at its default procedural rules.
- Mechanics:
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.5
  - All other TaskParams are left at their default values (melee_spawn_multiplier = 1.0, ranged_spawn_multiplier = 1.0, passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0, health_recover_multiplier = 1.0, health_loss_multiplier = 1.0, mana_recover_multiplier = 1.0, growing_plants_age = 600).</data>
