    <node id="task_317">
      <data key="d0">desc_generated</data>
      <data key="d1">generated</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to survive a dungeon floor with natural mob spawns, defeat enough hostile mobs to unlock the ladder, and descend to the Gnomish Mines.

Description: The agent begins on dungeon floor 1 at the ladder‑up position. It carries a stone sword (level 2), a bow, and 10 arrows; all needs are full, and it has no armour. Natural mob spawning is enabled at half intensity: melee and ranged spawn multipliers are 0.5, passive spawn multiplier is 1.0. The dungeon is pitch‑black, so the agent must use torches (looted from chests or pre‑placed on walls) to see. The ladder down is locked until the agent has killed at least 4 hostile mobs (any combination of orc soldiers and orc mages spawned by the natural population). After reaching the kill quota, the agent must locate the ladder‑down tile, stand on it, and execute DESCEND. Successfully entering floor 2 for the first time triggers ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES, which terminates the episode as a success. The episode fails if the agent dies or the time limit expires without achieving ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, FIND_BOW, and all earlier achievements implicitly satisfied by having stone tools and having already entered the dungeon (COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, COLLECT_STONE).

World:
- Player: Start on floor 1 (set_starting_floor(1)). Inventory: sword=2, bow=1, arrows=10; status bars at max (health, food, drink, energy, mana all 9). No armour.
- Map: No explicit block modifications; rely on the naturally generated dungeon (chests, fountains, pre‑placed torches).
- Mechanics:
  - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 4
  - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.5
  - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.5
  - passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0
  - All other TaskParams at default values.</data>
