      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to survive and navigate in the dark Gnomish Mines using torches, and collect a diamond from the ore veins on floor 2.

Description: The agent begins on floor 2 (Gnomish Mines) at the ladder-up position. The floor is pitch black (default lighting 0.0), and the agent carries 5 torches, an iron pickaxe (level 3), an iron sword (level 3), a bow, 20 arrows, and one piece of iron armour. Its inventory also includes 5 wood and 5 coal so it can craft more torches if needed. All needs (health, food, drink, energy, mana) start full. The task is to find and mine a single diamond block (BlockType.DIAMOND) using the iron pickaxe, which yields the COLLECT_DIAMOND achievement and signals task success. The diamond is generated by the default world-gen on floor 2, so no explicit block placement is required for it — the agent must explore, light its surroundings with torches, and mine. Melee mobs (Gnome Warriors, type_id=1) and ranged mobs (Gnome Archers, type_id=1) have very low spawn rates (0.1), and passive mobs (Bats, type_id=1; Snails, type_id=2) have a low spawn rate (0.2), creating a thin survival pressure. The floor-clear requirement is set to 1, so the ladder down is unlocked after the agent defeats any one hostile mob (if it encounters one). The primary challenge is darkness management: without placing torches, the agent cannot see ores, mobs, or navigate effectively. The episode fails if the agent dies or runs out of time without collecting a diamond.

Relevant Achievements: COLLECT_DIAMOND

Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, COLLECT_STONE, COLLECT_COAL, COLLECT_IRON, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_PICKAXE, MAKE_IRON_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_ARMOUR, PLACE_FURNACE, ENTER_DUNGEON, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES, FIND_BOW, MAKE_ARROW, FIRE_BOW

World:
- Player: Start on floor 2 (set_starting_floor(2)). Inventory: sword=3, pickaxe=3, bow=1, arrows=20, armour=1, torches=5, wood=5, coal=5; status bars at max. Attributes: dexterity=1, strength=1, intelligence=1.
- Map: No custom block or mob placements needed; rely on default Gnomish Mines generation (diamond veins are already present on floor 2). The floor-clear kill count for floor 1 is set to 8 (builder.set_monsters_killed(level=1, count=8)) and for floor 0 to 0.
- Mechanics:
  - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 1
  - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.1
  - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.1
  - passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.2
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0
  - All other TaskParams at default values.</data>
