      <data key="d2">Objective: Train the agent to clear the dungeon floor by defeating six hostile Orc‑type mobs that spawn over time and then descend to the Gnomish Mines.

Description: The episode starts on floor 1 at the ladder‑up position, with all needs (health, food, drink, energy, mana) at maximum. The agent carries an iron sword (level 3), a bow, 20 arrows, and a single piece of iron armour (defence +1). Normal mob spawning is active: melee, ranged, and passive spawn multipliers are set to 1.0, so Orc Soldiers (melee, type_id 2), Orc Mages (ranged, type_id 2), and Snails (passive) can appear according to the standard floor‑1 rules. The dungeon map is generated with its default rooms, corridors, torches in corners, chests, and fountains; no extra blocks or mobs are manually placed. The ladder down is locked until the agent kills a total of six hostile mobs (either type of orc). After meeting the kill requirement, the agent must reach the ladder‑down tile, stand on it, and execute DESCEND. Successfully entering floor 2 for the first time achieves ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES, which ends the episode as a success. Failure occurs if the agent dies or runs out of time without descending.

Relevant Achievements: DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, COLLECT_STONE, COLLECT_COAL, COLLECT_IRON, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_ARMOUR, PLACE_FURNACE, ENTER_DUNGEON, FIND_BOW, MAKE_ARROW, FIRE_BOW

World:
- Player: Start on floor 1 (set_starting_floor(1)). Inventory: sword=3, bow=1, arrows=20, armour=1. All status bars at maximum.
- Map: No manual modifications. The level uses the default dungeon generator for floor 1 (rooms, corridors, torches, chests, fountains).
- Mechanics:
