      <data key="d2">Objective: Defeat two orcs under natural spawn conditions and descend to the Gnomish Mines.

Description: The agent starts on Floor 1 (Dungeon) at the ladder‑up arrival point, equipped with a stone sword, a bow, 10 arrows, and 4 torches. Survival needs are enabled at a low rate (`needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.3`) so hunger and thirst accumulate slowly; health regeneration is moderately boosted (`health_recover_multiplier = 2.0`). No hostile mobs are pre‑placed. Instead, natural spawning is turned on with `melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.8` (producing Orc Soldiers) and `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.8` (producing Orc Mages), recreating a softer version of the real Dungeon environment. Passive mob spawning remains at `passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.3`, yielding snails for food if needed. The kill requirement `monsters_killed_to_clear_level` is set to 2. To succeed, the agent must defeat any two hostile mobs on this floor, which unlocks the ladder down, and then descend to Floor 2, triggering the `ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES` achievement. Standard Dungeon features (rooms, corridors, chests, fountains, torches) are unchanged.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, FIND_BOW

World:
- Player: `builder.set_starting_floor(1)`, inventory `{"stone_sword": 1, "bow": 1, "arrows": 10, "torches": 4}`; all survival stats (food, drink, energy, health, mana) at maximum (9/9). No other player modifications.
