      <data key="d2">Objective: Craft an iron sword, defeat a small group of orcs to unlock the descent, and descend into the Gnomish Mines.

Description: The agent starts on floor 1 (the dungeon) with a stone pickaxe, a stone sword, and small stacks of wood (3), stone (3), and coal (2). All mob spawning is disabled and survival needs are turned off, so the agent stays fully fed, hydrated, and rested. Two iron ore blocks are placed within 2–6 Manhattan distance of the player start on valid dungeon floors (STONE, WALL, or WALL_MOSS). Additionally, four hostile mobs are pre‑placed: two Orc Soldiers (melee, type_id=2) and two Orc Mages (ranged, type_id=2), randomly positioned within 5–15 Manhattan distance of the start. The ladder down to floor 2 (Gnomish Mines) is initially locked; to unlock it, the agent must defeat at least 3 hostile mobs (monsters_killed_to_clear_level is set to 3). The agent must use the initial resources to place a crafting table and furnace, mine at least one iron block, craft an iron sword, then hunt and kill three or more of the orcs to unlock the ladder, locate it, and descend. The episode succeeds when both MAKE_IRON_SWORD and ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES achievements are acquired (both must be true for termination).

Relevant Achievements: MAKE_IRON_SWORD, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, ENTER_DUNGEON

World:
- Player: Start on floor 1. Inventory: `{"wood": 3, "stone": 3, "coal": 2, "pickaxe": 2, "sword": 2}` (stone pickaxe, stone sword). Achievements MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, and ENTER_DUNGEON are completed.
- Map:
  - Place 2 iron ore blocks (BlockType.IRON) randomly within 2–6 Manhattan distance of the player start position, on any blocks of type STONE, WALL, or WALL_MOSS.
  - Add exactly two Orc Soldiers (melee mob, mob_name "Orc Soldier", type_id=2) randomly within 5–15 Manhattan distance of the player start.
  - Add exactly two Orc Mages (ranged mob, mob_name "Orc Mage", type_id=2) randomly within 5–15 Manhattan distance of the player start.
  - No other initial mobs, no other block modifications.
- Mechanics:
  - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 3
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0
  - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - All other TaskParams remain at their defaults (mob_health_multiplier = 1.0, mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0, health_recover_multiplier = 1.0, health_loss_multiplier = 1.0, mana_recover_multiplier = 1.0, etc.).</data>
