    <node id="task_406">
      <data key="d0">C</data>
      <data key="d1">generated</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to craft an iron sword and defeat both an Orc Soldier and an Orc Mage while mobs spawn around you in the dungeon.
Description: The agent begins on floor 1 (the dungeon) with a stone pickaxe, a stone sword, and small stacks of wood (3), stone (3), and coal (2). Unlike the previous task, hostile mob spawning is re‑enabled at a moderate level: melee spawn multiplier is set to 0.4 and ranged spawn multiplier to 0.2. Survival needs remain off (needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0). Three iron ore blocks are placed randomly within a Manhattan distance of 8–15 from the player’s start, on any STONE, WALL, or WALL_MOSS block. One Orc Soldier (melee, type_id = 2) and one Orc Mage (ranged, type_id = 2) are placed randomly within 10–15 Manhattan distance of the start. The agent must explore the dungeon, mine at least one iron block, place a crafting table and furnace, craft an iron sword, and then defeat both pre‑placed orcs (and any additional mobs that spawn). The episode succeeds only when MAKE_IRON_SWORD, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, and DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE are all achieved.
Relevant Achievements: MAKE_IRON_SWORD, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE
Completed Achievements: MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, ENTER_DUNGEON
World:
- Player: Starts on floor 1. Inventory: `{"wood": 3, "stone": 3, "coal": 2, "pickaxe": 2, "sword": 2}` (stone pickaxe, stone sword). Achievements MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, ENTER_DUNGEON are completed.
- Map:
  - Place 3 iron ore blocks (BlockType.IRON) randomly on floor 1 within 8–15 Manhattan distance of the player start, on any blocks of type STONE, WALL, or WALL_MOSS.
  - Add exactly one Orc Soldier (melee, mob_name "Orc Soldier", type_id=2) randomly within 10–15 Manhattan distance of the player start.
  - Add exactly one Orc Mage (ranged, mob_name "Orc Mage", type_id=2) randomly within 10–15 Manhattan distance of the player start.
  - No other initial mobs or block modifications.
- Mechanics:
  - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.4
  - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.2
  - passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0
  - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 8 (default)
  - All other TaskParams remain at defaults (mob_health_multiplier = 1.0, mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0, etc.).</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement, BlockType
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Learn to craft an iron sword and defeat both an Orc Soldier and an Orc Mage while mobs spawn around you in the dungeon.
Description: The agent begins on floor 1 (the dungeon) with a stone pickaxe, a stone sword, and small stacks of wood (3), stone (3), and coal (2). Unlike the previous task, hostile mob spawning is re‑enabled at a moderate level: melee spawn multiplier is set to 0.4 and ranged spawn multiplier to 0.2. Survival needs remain off (needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0). Three iron ore blocks are placed randomly within a Manhattan distance of 8–15 from the player’s start, on any STONE, WALL, or WALL_MOSS block. One Orc Soldier (melee, type_id = 2) and one Orc Mage (ranged, type_id = 2) are placed randomly within 10–15 Manhattan distance of the start. The agent must explore the dungeon, mine at least one iron block, place a crafting table and furnace, craft an iron sword, and then defeat both pre‑placed orcs (and any additional mobs that spawn). The episode succeeds only when MAKE_IRON_SWORD, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, and DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE are all achieved.
Relevant Achievements: MAKE_IRON_SWORD, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE
Completed Achievements: MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, ENTER_DUNGEON
World:
- Player: Starts on floor 1. Inventory: `{"wood": 3, "stone": 3, "coal": 2, "pickaxe": 2, "sword": 2}` (stone pickaxe, stone sword). Achievements MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, ENTER_DUNGEON are completed.
- Map:
  - Place 3 iron ore blocks (BlockType.IRON) randomly on floor 1 within 8–15 Manhattan distance of the player start, on any blocks of type STONE, WALL, or WALL_MOSS.
  - Add exactly one Orc Soldier (melee, mob_name "Orc Soldier", type_id=2) randomly within 10–15 Manhattan distance of the player start.
  - Add exactly one Orc Mage (ranged, mob_name "Orc Mage", type_id=2) randomly within 10–15 Manhattan distance of the player start.
  - No other initial mobs or block modifications.
- Mechanics:
  - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.4
  - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.2
  - passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.0
  - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 8 (default)
  - All other TaskParams remain at defaults (mob_health_multiplier = 1.0, mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0, etc.).
"""

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [
            Achievement.MAKE_IRON_SWORD,
            Achievement.DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER,
            Achievement.DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE,
        ]
        self.completed_achievements = [
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_SWORD,
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE,
            Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON,
        ]
        self.label = "MAKE_IRON_SWORD, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        """Return custom parameters for this task."""
        return TaskParams(
            melee_spawn_multiplier=0.4,
            ranged_spawn_multiplier=0.2,
            passive_spawn_multiplier=0.0,
            needs_depletion_multiplier=0.0,
            monsters_killed_to_clear_level=8,
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        """Generates the world for the task."""
        rng, build_rng, iron_rng, melee_rng, ranged_rng = jax.random.split(rng, 5)

        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)

        # Start on floor 1 (Dungeon)
        builder.set_starting_floor(1)

        # The player's starting position on this floor (the up-ladder)
        player_pos = builder.player_position

        # Give the starting inventory
        builder.set_player_inventory({
            "wood": 3,
            "stone": 3,
            "coal": 2,
            "pickaxe": 2,   # stone pickaxe
            "sword": 2,     # stone sword
        })

        # Place 3 iron ore blocks near the player, on stone/wall/moss
        builder.place_randomly_near(
            iron_rng,
            level=1,
            block_type=BlockType.IRON,
            target_pos=player_pos,
            min_dist=8,
            max_dist=15,
            n=3,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.STONE, BlockType.WALL, BlockType.WALL_MOSS],
        )

        # Place one Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2)
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            melee_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="melee",
            type_id=2,
            n=1,
            target_pos=player_pos,
            min_dist=10,
            max_dist=15,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH],
        )

        # Place one Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2)
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            ranged_rng,
            level=1,
            mob_name="ranged",
            type_id=2,
            n=1,
            target_pos=player_pos,
            min_dist=10,
            max_dist=15,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH],
        )

        # Assemble the state
        state = builder.build(rng)

        # Mark the pre‑completed achievements as True
        achievements = state.achievements
        for ach in self.completed_achievements:
            achievements = achievements.at[ach.value].set(True)
        state = state.replace(achievements=achievements)

        return state</data>
