      <data key="d1">generated</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective: Teach the agent to survive in the Dungeon under normal hunger/thirst/fatigue pressure while defeating 8 Orcs (Soldiers and Mages) to descend to the Gnomish Mines.

Description: This thin‑slice expansion raises the survival difficulty from the trained task by restoring normal needs depletion (`needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0`). The agent begins on floor 1 (the Dungeon) with the same combat-ready inventory (stone sword, bow, 20 arrows, 10 torches) and must kill exactly 8 hostile monsters – Orc Soldiers and Orc Mages – then use the ladder down. To make the increased survival pressure learnable without forcing a retreat to the Overworld, three RIPE_PLANT blocks are placed a short distance from the starting position, providing an immediate, renewable food source. The agent must still manage thirst by locating fountains, eat snails when available, and use potions from chests to sustain health and energy. All other game mechanics (mob spawn rates, health, damage, clear requirements) remain at their default values. Success is achieved when the agent reaches floor 2 (the Gnomish Mines).

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: FIND_BOW, MAKE_ARROW, MAKE_TORCH, MAKE_STONE_SWORD

World:
- Player: Starts on floor 1. Inventory: stone_sword=1, bow=1, arrows=20, torches=10. All armour slots empty. Attributes: strength=1, dexterity=1, intelligence=1. All status bars 9/9. Enchantments all 0. Learned spells both false.
- Map: On floor 1, place 3 RIPE_PLANT blocks at random positions within Manhattan distance 3 to 6 from the player’s spawn (the ladder‑up tile), exclusively on PATH (walkable ground) tiles. Use `builder.place_randomly_near(rng, 1, BlockType.RIPE_PLANT, player_position, min_dist=3, max_dist=6, n=3, on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH])`. No other manual block modifications; the default dungeon generation (rooms, corridors, chests, fountains, torches) is used.
- Mechanics:
  - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 8
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0
  - All other TaskParams at default (mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0, melee_spawn_multiplier = 1.0, ranged_spawn_multiplier = 1.0, passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0, mob_health_multiplier = 1.0, melee_trigger_distance = 10).</data>
