      <data key="d2">Objective: Teach the agent to clear a larger set of Orc threats inside the Dungeon before descending, scaling the “kill‑clear‑descend” pattern toward the full game’s requirement.

Description:
The agent begins on floor 1 (Dungeon) at the up‑ladder position. Starting inventory: 1 Stone Sword, 1 Bow, 15 Arrows, 6 Torches. No crafting or Overworld navigation is required; all needs are full. Instead of two pre‑placed enemies, **four** hostile mobs are positioned within the dungeon: two Orc Soldiers (melee, type_id = 2) and two Orc Mages (ranged, type_id = 2). Each mob is randomly placed using `add_mobs_randomly_near` with target position = the up‑ladder location, Manhattan distance min = 2 and max = 7, on any valid floor tiles, ensuring distinct placements (no collisions). The Dungeon generation is standard. The floor‑1 kill‑clear requirement (`monsters_killed_to_clear_level`) is set to 4, so the agent must defeat all four placed mobs to unlock the down ladder to floor 2. No other hostile mobs spawn anywhere (melee and ranged spawn multipliers are 0.0). The episode is successful when the agent achieves all three terminal achievements: defeating an Orc Soldier (`DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER`), defeating an Orc Mage (`DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE`), and descending to floor 2 (`ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES`). The agent must navigate the dungeon, manage health and light using torches, engage multiple enemies (including ranged attacks), and finally use the DESCEND action on the down ladder after enough kills.

Relevant Achievements: DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES
Completed Achievements: MAKE_STONE_SWORD, FIND_BOW, MAKE_TORCH
World:
- Player: Start on floor 1 (Dungeon). Inventory: {"stone_sword": 1, "bow": 1, "arrows": 15, "torch": 6}. Stats default (STR 1, DEX 1, INT 1). Needs maxed.
- Map:
  - Floor 1: add two Orc Soldiers (mob_name="melee", type_id=2) and two Orc Mages (mob_name="ranged", type_id=2), each placed independently with Manhattan distance min = 2, max = 7 from the up‑ladder position, using on_blocks valid walkable floor tiles, and ensuring no overlapping positions.
- Mechanics:
  - melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0
  - passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0 (to keep the dungeon free of incidental mobs)
  - monsters_killed_to_clear_level for floor 1 set to 4
  - all other TaskParams at default.</data>
