      <data key="d2">Objective: Teach the agent to clear the Dungeon (Floor 1) by defeating a larger group of orc soldiers and mages, then descend to the Gnomish Mines.

Description: This task builds directly on the parent by requiring the agent to kill 5 hostile monsters on Floor 1 instead of 3. All other conditions are identical. The agent starts on Floor 1 at the up‑ladder position, equipped with an iron sword. The dungeon layout uses standard procedural generation, including random chests, snails, and other features. The agent must explore, engage multiple orc soldiers and mages, and when 5 kills have been achieved, perform the DESCEND action while standing on the ladder down. Survival needs deplete at 0.2× their normal rate so that hunger/thirst do not interfere with combat training. The goal is to extend combat persistence and exploration depth, directly bridging the gap to the full game’s requirement of clearing Floor 1.

