      <data key="d2">Objective: Teach the agent to navigate a dark Dungeon, defeat several randomly‑spawning Orcs, and descend to the Gnomish Mines under moderate, realistic spawning pressure.

Description:
The agent begins on floor 1 (Dungeon) at the up‑ladder position. Starting inventory: 1 Stone Sword, 1 Bow, 20 Arrows, 10 Torches. All survival needs (health, food, drink, energy, mana) are set to maximum. No pre‑placed enemies exist—the agent must rely entirely on natural enemy spawning. The Dungeon generates normally (rooms, corridors, chests, fountains, darkness). Enemy spawning is enabled only for Orc‑type mobs on floor 1: melee Orc Soldier (type_id=2) and ranged Orc Mage (type_id=2). Spawn rates are dampened to `melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.5` and `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.5`, while passive spawns are disabled. The floor‑clear requirement is set to 4, meaning the agent must personally defeat a total of four hostile mobs to unlock the down ladder. The task succeeds only when the agent achieves all three goals: defeating at least one Orc Soldier, defeating at least one Orc Mage (they may come from spawns), and descending to floor 2 (`ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES`). The agent must actively explore the dungeon, use torches to navigate dark areas, manage health and ammunition, and initiate the `DESCEND` action on the down ladder after the kill quota is met.

Relevant Achievements: DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES
Completed Achievements: MAKE_STONE_SWORD, FIND_BOW, MAKE_ARROW, MAKE_TORCH
World:
- Player: Start on floor 1 (Dungeon). Inventory: {"stone_sword": 1, "bow": 1, "arrows": 20, "torch": 10}. Stats default (STR 1, DEX 1, INT 1). All needs maxed (Health 9, Food 9, Drink 9, Energy 9, Mana 9).
- Map: No pre‑placed blocks or mobs. The default Dungeon generation remains untouched (rooms, corridors, chests, fountains, darkness).
- Mechanics:
  - `melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.5`
  - `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.5`
  - `passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`
  - `monsters_killed_to_clear_level` for floor 1 set to 4
  - All other `TaskParams` at default (including standard mob health, damage, trigger distance, etc.).</data>
