      <data key="d2">Objective: Master combat in the Gnomish Mines by forcing the agent to locate and defeat a Gnome Warrior on floor 2, starting directly at the Dungeon exit with full gear.

Description: The agent begins on floor 1 (Dungeon) at the Up Ladder position. Its inventory contains a Wood Pickaxe, a Stone Sword, a Bow, 20 Arrows, 10 Torches, and a small buffer of Wood (20) and Stone (20). A Ladder Down to floor 2 is placed immediately adjacent to the Up Ladder, and the `monsters_killed_to_clear_level` requirement is set to 0 for all floors, so the agent can descend to the Gnomish Mines instantly without clearing the Dungeon. On floor 2, a single Gnome Warrior has been pre‑placed within 3‑8 tiles of the player’s spawn, ensuring an early encounter. Ranged mob spawns are disabled to simplify the learning environment; only melee Gnome Warriors (and possibly normal passive mobs if enabled, but passive spawns are set to 0 as well) can appear, keeping the threat focused. Survival needs are drastically slowed (depletion multiplier 0.2) and mob damage remains at 75% to keep the combat manageable while the agent learns the new enemy. The episode is a success only when the agent both enters the Gnomish Mines (descend to floor 2) and defeats a Gnome Warrior.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES, DEFEAT_GNOME_WARRIOR  
Completed Achievements: MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, FIND_BOW  

World:
- Player: Starts on floor 1, at the dungeon Up Ladder position. Inventory: wood_pickaxe = 1, stone_sword = 1, bow = 1, arrows = 20, torch = 10, wood = 20, stone = 20. Attributes: strength = 1, dexterity = 1, intelligence = 1. Health/food/drink/energy/mana all 9/9. Weapon/armour enchantments 0. No learned spells.
- Map:  
  1. On floor 1, place a `LADDER_DOWN` block in a valid empty tile adjacent to the existing `LADDER_UP`, using `place_adjacent_to_existing` with `block_to_place=BlockType.LADDER_DOWN`, `target_block_type=BlockType.LADDER_UP`, `on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH]` (or any walkable ground).  
  2. On floor 2, add exactly one Gnome Warrior melee mob (`mob_name="Gnome Warrior"`, `type_id=0`) near the player’s spawn point using `add_mobs_randomly_near` with `min_dist=3`, `max_dist=8`, `on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH, BlockType.STONE]`.  
- Mechanics:  
  - `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 0` (applies to all floors)  
  - `needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.2`  
  - `mob_damage_multiplier = 0.75`  
  - `melee_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`  
  - `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`  
  - `passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`  
  - All other TaskParams at default values.</data>
