      <data key="d0">desc_generated</data>
      <data key="d1">generated</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to defeat the standard-strength Orc Soldier and Orc Mage in the Dungeon and descend to the Gnomish Mines.

Description: The player spawns on Floor 1 (the Dungeon) at the Ladder Up position, equipped with a wood sword, a bow, 15 arrows, and 10 torches. All player stats are fully refreshed (health 9, food 9, drink 9, energy 9, mana 9) and attributes are base (1/1/1). All natural mob spawns are disabled by setting all spawn multipliers to 0.0. The only hostile enemies present are one Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) and one Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2), placed randomly on PATH blocks within a Manhattan distance of 3 to 7 from the player’s starting position. The floor’s monster kill count starts at 0, and the level‑clear threshold (`monsters_killed_to_clear_level`) is 2, so the ladder down unlocks as soon as both enemies are defeated. Standard dungeon rooms, chests, and fountains are still generated but contain no extra mobs. Mob health and damage are set to their default values (multiplier 1.0) – the same as the full Craftax game. The task is successful when the player uses the ladder down, achieving `ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES`.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, FIND_BOW, MAKE_ARROW, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, MAKE_TORCH

World:
- Player: `builder.set_starting_floor(1)`. Inventory: `{"sword": 1, "bow": 1, "arrows": 15, "torches": 10}`. All stats at maximum, attributes at 1/1/1.
- Map: `builder.set_monsters_killed(level=1, count=0)`. Place one Orc Soldier: `builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(rng, 1, "melee", 2, n=1, target_pos=player_start_pos, min_dist=3, max_dist=7, on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH])`. Place one Orc Mage: `builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(rng, 1, "ranged", 2, n=1, target_pos=player_start_pos, min_dist=3, max_dist=7, on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH])`.
- Mechanics: `passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`, `melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`, `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`. `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 2`. `mob_health_multiplier = 1.0`, `mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0`. All other TaskParams remain at default values.</data>
