      <data key="d2">Objective: Teach the agent to craft an iron sword, defeat four orcs in the Dungeon, and descend to the Gnomish Mines.

Description: The agent starts on Floor 0 with a stone pickaxe, a wood sword, and small amounts of wood and stone. A crafting table and a furnace are already placed near spawn (at (25,25) and (23,25)), and the Overworld’s ladder down is unlocked (monsters_killed_to_clear_level on floor 0 = 8). Two coal blocks and two iron blocks are placed within a 3‑tile radius, exactly replicating the parent task’s workshop. The agent must mine these resources, stand next to both the table and furnace, and craft an iron sword (consuming 1 wood, 1 stone, 1 iron, 1 coal). All other mob spawns are disabled. Once holding the iron sword, the agent descends to Floor 1 (Dungeon). On that floor, four hostile mobs are pre‑placed: two Orc Soldiers (melee, type_id=2) and two Orc Mages (ranged, type_id=2), positioned randomly between 3 and 7 Manhattan distance from the spawn‑in point. The floor‑clear requirement is raised to 4 kills (monsters_killed_to_clear_level=4), meaning the ladder down to the Gnomish Mines only becomes usable after all four are defeated. The task succeeds when the agent, after forging the iron sword, kills all four orcs and then uses the DESCEND action on the ladder down to enter Floor 2 (Gnomish Mines). Survival needs deplete at 75% of the normal rate to keep the focus on combat. All other TaskParams remain at the parent values (no other mobs spawn, standard health/damage scaling).

Relevant Achievements: MAKE_IRON_SWORD, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES.

Completed Achievements: MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, PLACE_TABLE, PLACE_FURNACE.

World:
