      <data key="d2">Objective: Teach the agent to craft an iron sword from scratch (without any pre-supplied tools or resources) and then clear the Dungeon to enter the Gnomish Mines.

Description: This task removes all inventory scaffolding from the parent. The agent starts on Floor 0 (Overworld) with absolutely no items—no pickaxe, no wood, no stone. It must gather wood, craft a wood pickaxe, collect stone, craft a stone pickaxe, then locate and mine at least one coal and one iron ore. After placing a crafting table and furnace, it must craft an iron sword. Once equipped, the agent must descend to Floor 1 (Dungeon), defeat at least 5 hostile monsters (orc soldiers and mages) to unlock the ladder, and finally use DESCEND while standing on the ladder down to reach Floor 2 (Gnomish Mines). Survival needs deplete very slowly (0.2×) to keep focus on the tool-crafting chain and combat. All other game mechanics (mob health, damage, spawn rates) remain at default (1.0×). The episode succeeds only when both MAKE_IRON_SWORD and ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES are achieved.

Relevant Achievements: MAKE_IRON_SWORD, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: None (the agent starts with no items and no tools, so no achievements are implicitly satisfied).

World:
- Player: `builder.set_starting_floor(0)`. Inventory: `builder.set_player_inventory({})` (empty).
- Map:
  - `builder.set_monsters_killed(level=1, count=0)` to reset the Floor 1 kill counter to zero.
  - All floors use default generation with no other block modifications.
- Mechanics:
  - `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 5`
  - `needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.2`
  - All other TaskParams left at their default values (e.g., `mob_health_multiplier = 1.0`, `mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0`, spawn multipliers all 1.0).</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Teach the agent to craft an iron sword from scratch (without any pre-supplied tools or resources) and then clear the Dungeon to enter the Gnomish Mines.

Description: This task removes all inventory scaffolding from the parent. The agent starts on Floor 0 (Overworld) with absolutely no items—no pickaxe, no wood, no stone. It must gather wood, craft a wood pickaxe, collect stone, craft a stone pickaxe, then locate and mine at least one coal and one iron ore. After placing a crafting table and furnace, it must craft an iron sword. Once equipped, the agent must descend to Floor 1 (Dungeon), defeat at least 5 hostile monsters (orc soldiers and mages) to unlock the ladder, and finally use DESCEND while standing on the ladder down to reach Floor 2 (Gnomish Mines). Survival needs deplete very slowly (0.2×) to keep focus on the tool-crafting chain and combat. All other game mechanics (mob health, damage, spawn rates) remain at default (1.0×). The episode succeeds only when both MAKE_IRON_SWORD and ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES are achieved.

Relevant Achievements: MAKE_IRON_SWORD, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: None (the agent starts with no items and no tools, so no achievements are implicitly satisfied).

World:
- Player: `builder.set_starting_floor(0)`. Inventory: `builder.set_player_inventory({})` (empty).
- Map:
  - `builder.set_monsters_killed(level=1, count=0)` to reset the Floor 1 kill counter to zero.
  - All floors use default generation with no other block modifications.
- Mechanics:
  - `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 5`
  - `needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.2`
  - All other TaskParams left at their default values (e.g., `mob_health_multiplier = 1.0`, `mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0`, spawn multipliers all 1.0).
"""

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [
            Achievement.MAKE_IRON_SWORD,
            Achievement.ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES,
        ]
        self.completed_achievements = []   # No pre-completed achievements
        self.label = "MAKE_IRON_SWORD, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        """Return custom parameters for this task."""
        return TaskParams(
            needs_depletion_multiplier=0.2,
            monsters_killed_to_clear_level=5,
            # All other multipliers default to 1.0
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        """Generates the world for the task."""
        rng, build_rng = jax.random.split(rng)

        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)

        # Start on floor 0 (Overworld) at default centre
        builder.set_starting_floor(0)

        # Empty starting inventory
        builder.set_player_inventory({})

        # Reset floor 1 kill counter to zero (must earn 5 kills to unlock ladder)
        builder.set_monsters_killed(1, 0)

        state = builder.build(rng)

        # No achievements are pre-completed, so no modifications needed
        return state</data>
