      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to survive and clear Floor 1 with stone weapons under realistic hunger/thirst/fatigue pressure and standard orc mage density, in order to enter the Gnomish Mines.

Description: The agent begins on Floor 0 with 20 wood and 20 stone. It must place a crafting table, craft a wood pickaxe and wood sword, then upgrade to a stone pickaxe and stone sword. After defeating 8 hostile mobs (zombies, skeletons) to unlock the ladder, it descends into the Dungeon (Floor 1). There it must locate the randomly‑placed ladder down, defeat 8 hostile mobs (orc soldiers and orc mages), and finally DESCEND into the Gnomish Mines (Floor 2).  
**This task differs from the parent by applying normal survival pressure (needs depletion 1.0×, health recovery 1.0×) and a full, original ranged spawn rate of 1.0**, so the agent must actively forage for food and water while fighting. To keep the challenge learnable, two passive cows are placed near the starting area (within 2–5 Manhattan tiles) to supply immediate food, and plant growth is accelerated (maturation at 300 ticks instead of 600) so farming provides a reliable fallback. All other mechanics remain at their default values. Success requires acquiring all six relevant achievements; the episode terminates with success only when the agent steps onto the ladder down on Floor 1 after completing all prerequisites.

Relevant Achievements: MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, ENTER_DUNGEON, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: (none)

