    <node id="task_512">
      <data key="d0">desc_generated</data>
      <data key="d1">generated</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective: Master floor‑1 dungeon combat and survival under normal needs pressure by descending to the Gnomish Mines with a pre‑equipped iron sword.

Description:
The agent begins on floor 1 (Dungeon) at the position of the “ladder up” (the default spawn for that level). Its inventory contains an iron sword (level 3), a bow, 20 arrows, and 10 torches. All intrinsic status bars (health, food, drink, energy, mana) start full at 9/9. The Overworld crafting stations and resource patches are not used; the agent is placed directly into the dungeon with combat‑ready gear.
The only goal is to earn the ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES achievement: kill the required 8 hostile mobs (orc soldiers, orc mages) on floor 1, locate the ladder down, and step on it to descend to floor 2.
All combat parameters remain at default (mob health multiplier 1.0, damage multiplier 1.0, spawn multipliers 1.0). Survival mechanics are set to normal speed: `needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0`, while health recovery, health loss, and mana recovery stay at 1.0. The agent must therefore manage its food and drink by consuming defeated snails or potions found in chests while fighting, a vital skill for the full Craftax.
No manual block placements are made on any floor; the entire 9‑level world uses natural generation.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, COLLECT_STONE, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, PLACE_FURNACE, COLLECT_COAL, COLLECT_IRON, MAKE_IRON_SWORD

World:
- Player:
  - `set_starting_floor(1)`
  - `set_player_inventory({"sword": 3, "bow": 1, "arrows": 20, "torch": 10})`
  - All attributes default (dex=1, str=1, int=1)
- Map:
  - No block modifications; all nine levels use the standard procedural generation.
- Mechanics:
  - `needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0`
  - `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 8` (used for floor 1, the default for all floors except floor 0)
  - All other `TaskParams` at default: `mob_health_multiplier = 1.0`, `mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0`, `melee_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`, `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`, `passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`, `health_recover_multiplier = 1.0`, `health_loss_multiplier = 1.0`, `mana_recover_multiplier = 1.0`, `growing_plants_age = 600`.</data>
