      <data key="d2">Objective: Train the agent to survive and descend from the Gnomish Mines (Floor 2) to the Sewers, focusing on operating in permanent darkness and defeating Gnome Warriors and Gnome Archers using natural spawns.

Description:
The agent begins on Floor 2 (Gnomish Mines) with the equipment it would plausibly have after clearing the Dungeon: a Stone Sword, a Stone Pickaxe, and 5 Torches. Survival pressure is half the normal rate (`needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.5`), requiring the agent to manage food, water, and energy. To provide a water source on this otherwise dry floor, a Fountain is placed adjacent to the ladder‑up tile (using `place_adjacent_to_existing`). The ladder down is locked until the agent defeats 4 hostile mobs (Gnome Warriors and Gnome Archers). All spawning is handled by the default game mechanics – no enemies are pre‑placed. Hostile and passive spawn rates are set to 1.0, and mob health/damage are unchanged from Craftax defaults. The task is successful when the agent uses the ladder on Floor 2 to descend to Floor 3, triggering `ENTER_SEWERS`.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_SEWERS

Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, COLLECT_STONE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, ENTER_DUNGEON, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

World:
- Player: Start on Floor 2. Inventory: stone sword, stone pickaxe, 5 torches. Stats default (STR 1, DEX 1, INT 1). All status bars full (Health, Food, Drink, Energy, Mana = 9/9).
- Map:
  * Place a Fountain on Floor 2 directly adjacent to the ladder‑up tile using `place_adjacent_to_existing` with `block_to_place=BlockType.FOUNTAIN`, `target_block_type=BlockType.LADDER_UP`, and `on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH, BlockType.GRASS]`.
- Mechanics:
