      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to scour the Dungeon for chests to acquire a bow and torches, then use those resources to defeat a full complement of Orc Soldiers and Mages and descend to the Gnomish Mines.

Description: The agent begins on Floor 1 (the Dungeon) carrying only a stone sword (tier‑2 melee weapon) and with all survival meters (health, food, drink, energy, mana) at their maximum of 9/9. No bow, arrows, torches, or other items are present in the inventory. The world uses the standard procedural dungeon generation without any block modifications. All mob spawn and survival parameters are returned to the original Craftax defaults: hostile spawns occur at normal rates (melee_spawn_multiplier = 1.0, ranged_spawn_multiplier = 1.0), passive mobs spawn at the normal rate (passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0), hunger/thirst/fatigue accumulate at the normal speed (needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0), and health regenerates at the normal rate when satiated (health_recover_multiplier = 1.0). The ladder down is locked until 8 hostile monsters (Orc Soldiers and Orc Mages) are defeated (monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 8). The agent must navigate the Dungeon rooms and corridors, find and open chests to obtain a bow (and, optionally, extra arrows or torches from the chests), then engage and kill the required number of enemies. Ranged combat with the bow is essential because orc mages attack from a distance. The episode terminates successfully only when the ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES achievement is earned by descending the cleared ladder.

Relevant Achievements: OPEN_CHEST, FIND_BOW, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES
Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, COLLECT_STONE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, COLLECT_COAL, PLACE_FURNACE, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, COLLECT_DRINK, EAT_COW, WAKE_UP, PLACE_PLANT, COLLECT_SAPLING, EAT_PLANT, DEFEAT_ZOMBIE, DEFEAT_SKELETON, ENTER_DUNGEON
World:
- Player: Starting floor 1; inventory: stone sword × 1; all survival stats (food, drink, energy, health, mana) = 9/9; attributes: STR=1, DEX=1, INT=1; no learned spells; no bow, arrows, or torches.
- Map: No modifications; all levels use standard procedural generation.
- Mechanics:
    "melee_spawn_multiplier": 1.0,
    "ranged_spawn_multiplier": 1.0,
    "passive_spawn_multiplier": 1.0,
    "needs_depletion_multiplier": 1.0,
    "health_recover_multiplier": 1.0,
    "monsters_killed_to_clear_level": 8</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement, BlockType
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Learn to scour the Dungeon for chests to acquire a bow and torches, then use those resources to defeat a full complement of Orc Soldiers and Mages and descend to the Gnomish Mines.

Description: The agent begins on Floor 1 (the Dungeon) carrying only a stone sword (tier‑2 melee weapon) and with all survival meters (health, food, drink, energy, mana) at their maximum of 9/9. No bow, arrows, torches, or other items are present in the inventory. The world uses the standard procedural dungeon generation without any block modifications. All mob spawn and survival parameters are returned to the original Craftax defaults: hostile spawns occur at normal rates (melee_spawn_multiplier = 1.0, ranged_spawn_multiplier = 1.0), passive mobs spawn at the normal rate (passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0), hunger/thirst/fatigue accumulate at the normal speed (needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0), and health regenerates at the normal rate when satiated (health_recover_multiplier = 1.0). The ladder down is locked until 8 hostile monsters (Orc Soldiers and Orc Mages) are defeated (monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 8). The agent must navigate the Dungeon rooms and corridors, find and open chests to obtain a bow (and, optionally, extra arrows or torches from the chests), then engage and kill the required number of enemies. Ranged combat with the bow is essential because orc mages attack from a distance. The episode terminates successfully only when the ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES achievement is earned by descending the cleared ladder.

Relevant Achievements: OPEN_CHEST, FIND_BOW, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES
Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, COLLECT_STONE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, COLLECT_COAL, PLACE_FURNACE, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, COLLECT_DRINK, EAT_COW, WAKE_UP, PLACE_PLANT, COLLECT_SAPLING, EAT_PLANT, DEFEAT_ZOMBIE, DEFEAT_SKELETON, ENTER_DUNGEON
World:
- Player: Starting floor 1; inventory: stone sword × 1; all survival stats (food, drink, energy, health, mana) = 9/9; attributes: STR=1, DEX=1, INT=1; no learned spells; no bow, arrows, or torches.
- Map: No modifications; all levels use standard procedural generation.
- Mechanics:
    "melee_spawn_multiplier": 1.0,
    "ranged_spawn_multiplier": 1.0,
    "passive_spawn_multiplier": 1.0,
    "needs_depletion_multiplier": 1.0,
    "health_recover_multiplier": 1.0,
    "monsters_killed_to_clear_level": 8
"""

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [
            Achievement.OPEN_CHEST,
            Achievement.FIND_BOW,
            Achievement.ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES,
        ]
        self.completed_achievements = [
            Achievement.COLLECT_WOOD,
            Achievement.PLACE_TABLE,
            Achievement.MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE,
            Achievement.COLLECT_STONE,
            Achievement.MAKE_WOOD_SWORD,
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE,
            Achievement.COLLECT_COAL,
            Achievement.PLACE_FURNACE,
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_SWORD,
            Achievement.COLLECT_DRINK,
            Achievement.EAT_COW,
            Achievement.WAKE_UP,
            Achievement.PLACE_PLANT,
            Achievement.COLLECT_SAPLING,
            Achievement.EAT_PLANT,
            Achievement.DEFEAT_ZOMBIE,
            Achievement.DEFEAT_SKELETON,
            Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON,
        ]
        self.label = "OPEN_CHEST, FIND_BOW, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        """Return custom parameters for this task."""
        return TaskParams(
            melee_spawn_multiplier=1.0,
            ranged_spawn_multiplier=1.0,
            passive_spawn_multiplier=1.0,
            needs_depletion_multiplier=1.0,
            health_recover_multiplier=1.0,
            monsters_killed_to_clear_level=8,
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        """Generates the world for the task."""
        rng, build_rng = jax.random.split(rng)

        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)

        # Start on floor 1 (Dungeon) at the up‑ladder position
        builder.set_starting_floor(1)

        # Equip starting inventory: stone sword (tier 2)
        builder.set_player_inventory({
            "sword": 2,   # stone sword
        })

        # Ensure the dungeon kill counter is zero so the agent must kill 8 monsters
        builder.set_monsters_killed(level=1, count=0)

        state = builder.build(rng)

        # Mark pre‑completed achievements as True
        achievements = state.achievements
        for ach in self.completed_achievements:
            achievements = achievements.at[ach.value].set(True)
        state = state.replace(achievements=achievements)

        return state</data>
