      <data key="d2">Objective: Develop the ability to fight gnome mobs in darkness and clear the Gnomish Mines floor to unlock the descent to the Sewers.

Description: The agent starts on floor 2 (Gnomish Mines) at the ladder‑up position. The mines are pitch black (default). The agent carries a stone sword, an iron pickaxe, a bow, 20 arrows, and 20 torches. Starting stats are strength=2, dexterity=1, intelligence=1, with all vitals at maximum (9/9). A fountain block is placed exactly one tile away from the player (via place_randomly_near with n=1, min_dist=1, max_dist=1) to provide water. The level clearance is set to 4 kills (monsters_killed_to_clear = 4). Hostile spawn rates are normal (melee=1.0, ranged=1.0, passive=1.0). Survival needs deplete slowly (needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.3). The agent must navigate using torches, fight Gnome Warriors and Gnome Archers to accumulate 4 kills, then descend the ladder down to floor 3, earning ENTER_SEWERS. The isolated setup bypasses overworld and dungeon, focusing entirely on the mines combat and navigation bottleneck.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_SEWERS

Completed Achievements: (none)

World:
- Player: Starting floor 2. Inventory: stone_sword=1, iron_pickaxe=1, bow=1, arrows=20, torches=20. Player stats: strength=2.
- Map: Use builder.place_randomly_near to place 1 BlockType.FOUNTAIN within distance 1 of the player’s spawn on floor 2.
- Mechanics:
  - monsters_killed_to_clear = 4
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.3
  - melee_spawn_multiplier = 1.0
  - ranged_spawn_multiplier = 1.0
  - passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0
  - (all other TaskParams remain default)</data>
