      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to self‑sufficiently craft an iron sword on the Overworld before descending to the Dungeon for combat.

Description: The agent starts on Floor 0 (Overworld) at its default centre position, equipped with a stone pickaxe (tier 2) in its inventory. A crafting table and a furnace are pre‑placed adjacent to the spawn location: the table at (36, 35) and the furnace at (36, 37) – these correspond to the blocks immediately north and south of the center point. The goal is to first gather the required materials (1 wood, 1 stone, 1 iron, 1 coal) and craft an iron sword by standing near both the table and furnace, then descend to Floor 1 (Dungeon) and defeat exactly five hostile monsters (orc soldiers or orc mages) to unlock access to the Gnomish Mines. Normal survival pressure applies, and all mob and recovery multipliers remain at 1.0. The Overworld ladder is already open (monsters_killed[0] default), so no overworld combat is required.

Relevant Achievements: MAKE_IRON_SWORD, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES
Completed Achievements: MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, PLACE_TABLE, PLACE_FURNACE, ENTER_DUNGEON

