    <node id="task_688">
      <data key="d0">D</data>
      <data key="d1">generated</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective: Introduce the agent to the Gnomish Mines (floor 2) combat, requiring it to clear the level and descend to the Sewers (floor 3).

Description:
The agent starts on floor 2 (Gnomish Mines) with a stone sword, a wood pickaxe, torches, and basic resources. Survival needs deplete at half the normal rate (`needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.5`) so that hunger, thirst, and fatigue do not distract from the new combat challenge. The floor 2 ladder down remains locked until the agent defeats **eight** hostile monsters – the same intensified requirement as the parent task, but now against gnome warriors and archers. Two gnomes are pre‑placed near the spawn point to guarantee early confrontation: one Gnome Warrior (`mob_name="melee"`, `type_id=1`) and one Gnome Archer (`mob_name="ranged"`, `type_id=1`), each within Manhattan distance 2–4 from the up‑ladder position on distinct, non‑colliding tiles. The agent may use natural spawns of bats and snails for food, mine coal/iron, craft iron‑tier equipment, and place torches to navigate the pitch‑black mines. The episode is successful only when the agent uses the floor 2 down‑ladder to enter floor 3, earning `ENTER_SEWERS`.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_SEWERS

Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, COLLECT_STONE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, ENTER_DUNGEON, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

