- Player: Start on floor 2 at the ladder‑up position. Inventory: stone sword (tier 2), stone pickaxe (tier 2), bow, 15 arrows, 5 torches. Stats: health 9, food 9, drink 9, energy 9, mana 9; STR 1, DEX 1, INT 1. No enchantments or learned spells.
