      <data key="d2">Objective: Survive in the dark Gnomish Mines (floor 2), defeat gnome warriors and archers, and descend into the Sewers (floor 3).

Description: The agent starts on floor 2 (the Gnomish Mines) at the position of the up‑ladder it would have used to arrive. It is equipped with an iron sword, a stone pickaxe, a bow, 10 arrows, and 20 torches—a loadout consistent with having competently progressed through the overworld and dungeon. All prior floor unlocks and crafting achievements that led to this gear are marked as completed. The floor is normally generated: pitch‑black (light level 0.0), with winding caverns, stalagmites, coal, iron, diamond, sapphire, and ruby ore deposits scattered in stone, and lava lakes. Hostile gnome warriors (melee) and gnome archers (ranged) spawn as usual. The agent must kill at least 3 hostile monsters on this floor to activate the ladder down to floor 3. After meeting the kill requirement, it must locate and stand on the down‑ladder and descend. Descending to floor 3 unlocks the ENTER_SEWERS achievement, which immediately ends the task in success. The low kill count (monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 3) ensures the focus remains on the new environment and enemies, not on a lengthy grind. Survival needs deplete at normal rates, but the agent begins with full food, water, energy, and health.

