Relevant Achievements: COLLECT_IRON, MAKE_IRON_SWORD, ENTER_SEWERS

Completed Achievements: MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, PLACE_TABLE, PLACE_FURNACE, ENTER_DUNGEON, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

World:
