      <data key="d2">Objective: Clear the Dungeon floor through sustained combat, managing hunger with passive mobs, and descend to the Gnomish Mines using only a stone sword and torches.

Description: The agent spawns on Floor 1 (the Dungeon) at the Ladder‑Up position, carrying a stone sword (tier 2) and 10 torches (inventory: `{"sword": 2, "torches": 10}`). All stats are maxed (health 9, food 9, drink 9, energy 9, mana 9) and attributes are base (strength=1, dexterity=1, intelligence=1). Two orc enemies are hand‑placed on PATH tiles within Manhattan distance 5–10 from the start: one Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) and one Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2). Hostile spawning operates at full intensity (melee and ranged multipliers 1.0), and the pitch‑black dungeon (default light level 0.0) triggers night bonuses for melee spawns. To make prolonged survival feasible, passive mob spawning is enabled at normal rate (`passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`), allowing Snails to appear as a food source. The level‑clear threshold is increased to `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 8`, so the agent must defeat the two hand‑placed orcs plus at least six additional hostile mobs (zombies, skeletons, or further orcs) to unlock the Ladder Down. Torches can be placed to improve visibility and reduce spawn bonuses; chests and fountains spawn as usual in the dungeon. The task is completed when the agent descends the Ladder Down, earning `ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES`.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_TORCH

World:
- Player: `builder.set_starting_floor(1)`. Inventory: `{"sword": 2, "torches": 10}`. All stats maxed, attributes 1/1/1.
- Map: `builder.set_monsters_killed(level=1, count=0)`.  
  Hand‑place Orc Soldier: `builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(rng, 1, "melee", 2, n=1, target_pos=player_start_pos, min_dist=5, max_dist=10, on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH])`.  
  Hand‑place Orc Mage: `builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(rng, 1, "ranged", 2, n=1, target_pos=player_start_pos, min_dist=5, max_dist=10, on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH])`.
- Mechanics: `passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`, `melee_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`, `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`. `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 8`. `mob_health_multiplier = 1.0`, `mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0`. All other TaskParams at defaults.</data>
