      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to defeat a Gnome Warrior in the dark Gnomish Mines.

Description:
The agent begins on floor 2 (Gnomish Mines) already competent from earlier dungeon runs. The world is pitch‑black, littered with stalagmites, lava pockets, and valuable ores. A stone sword, a bow, 20 arrows, and 15 torches are provided in the starting inventory; no other tools or armour are given. A water fountain is placed within a few metres of the spawn point to ensure thirst never becomes a distraction. Two Gnome Warriors (melee, type_id=1) and one Gnome Archer (ranged, type_id=1) are seeded near the start to guarantee combat encounters. Survival needs deplete at 75% of normal speed, preserving some metabolic pressure without overwhelming the new task. All other game mechanics (mob damage, health, spawn rates) remain at default. The episode succeeds as soon as the agent defeats its first Gnome Warrior (DEFEAT_GNOME_WARRIOR). The agent may also engage the Archer, eat bats, or collect resources, but none are required.

Relevant Achievements: DEFEAT_GNOME_WARRIOR
Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES, FIND_BOW, FIRE_BOW, MAKE_ARROW, MAKE_TORCH, PLACE_TORCH, MAKE_STONE_SWORD
World:
- Player: Starts on floor 2 (Gnomish Mines). Inventory: stone_sword=1, bow=1, arrows=20, torches=15. All other inventory slots empty. Attributes: strength=1, dexterity=1, intelligence=1. Status bars at 9/9. No weapon or armour enchantments, no learned spells.
- Map:
  - place_randomly_near: On floor 2, place one BlockType.FOUNTAIN within 2–5 Manhattan of the player's start position, on PATH or STONE.
  - add_mobs_randomly_near: On floor 2, add 2 melee mobs (mob_name="melee", type_id=1) within 5–12 Manhattan of the player's start, on PATH or STONE.
  - add_mobs_randomly_near: On floor 2, add 1 ranged mob (mob_name="ranged", type_id=1) within 5–12 Manhattan of the player's start, on PATH or STONE.
- Mechanics:
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.75
  - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 8 (not relevant, kept default)
  - All other TaskParams remain at default.</data>
      <data key="d3">import jax
from craftax.craftax.constants import Achievement, BlockType
from craftax.craftax.craftax_state import EnvParams, StaticEnvParams

from minicraftax.craftax_state import EnvState, TaskParams
from minicraftax.tasks.base_task import BaseTask
from minicraftax.world_builder import WorldBuilder


class Env(BaseTask):
    """Objective: Learn to defeat a Gnome Warrior in the dark Gnomish Mines.

Description:
The agent begins on floor 2 (Gnomish Mines) already competent from earlier dungeon runs. The world is pitch‑black, littered with stalagmites, lava pockets, and valuable ores. A stone sword, a bow, 20 arrows, and 15 torches are provided in the starting inventory; no other tools or armour are given. A water fountain is placed within a few metres of the spawn point to ensure thirst never becomes a distraction. Two Gnome Warriors (melee, type_id=1) and one Gnome Archer (ranged, type_id=1) are seeded near the start to guarantee combat encounters. Survival needs deplete at 75% of normal speed, preserving some metabolic pressure without overwhelming the new task. All other game mechanics (mob damage, health, spawn rates) remain at default. The episode succeeds as soon as the agent defeats its first Gnome Warrior (DEFEAT_GNOME_WARRIOR). The agent may also engage the Archer, eat bats, or collect resources, but none are required.

Relevant Achievements: DEFEAT_GNOME_WARRIOR
Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES, FIND_BOW, FIRE_BOW, MAKE_ARROW, MAKE_TORCH, PLACE_TORCH, MAKE_STONE_SWORD
World:
- Player: Starts on floor 2 (Gnomish Mines). Inventory: stone_sword=1, bow=1, arrows=20, torches=15. All other inventory slots empty. Attributes: strength=1, dexterity=1, intelligence=1. Status bars at 9/9. No weapon or armour enchantments, no learned spells.
- Map:
  - place_randomly_near: On floor 2, place one BlockType.FOUNTAIN within 2–5 Manhattan of the player's start position, on PATH or STONE.
  - add_mobs_randomly_near: On floor 2, add 2 melee mobs (mob_name="melee", type_id=1) within 5–12 Manhattan of the player's start, on PATH or STONE.
  - add_mobs_randomly_near: On floor 2, add 1 ranged mob (mob_name="ranged", type_id=1) within 5–12 Manhattan of the player's start, on PATH or STONE.
- Mechanics:
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.75
  - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 8 (not relevant, kept default)
  - All other TaskParams remain at default.
"""

    def __init__(self, static_params: StaticEnvParams, params: EnvParams):
        super().__init__(static_params, params)
        self.relevant_achievements = [
            Achievement.DEFEAT_GNOME_WARRIOR,
        ]
        self.completed_achievements = [
            Achievement.ENTER_DUNGEON,
            Achievement.ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES,
            Achievement.FIND_BOW,
            Achievement.FIRE_BOW,
            Achievement.MAKE_ARROW,
            Achievement.MAKE_TORCH,
            Achievement.PLACE_TORCH,
            Achievement.MAKE_STONE_SWORD,
        ]
        self.label = "DEFEAT_GNOME_WARRIOR"

    def get_task_params(self) -&gt; TaskParams:
        """Return custom parameters for this task."""
        return TaskParams(
            needs_depletion_multiplier=0.75,
        )

    def generate_world(self, rng: jax.Array) -&gt; EnvState:
        """Generates the world for the task."""
        rng, build_rng, place_rng, mob_rng = jax.random.split(rng, 4)
        mob_rng1, mob_rng2, mob_rng3 = jax.random.split(mob_rng, 3)

        builder = WorldBuilder(build_rng, self.static_params, self.params)

        # Start on floor 2 (Gnomish Mines)
        builder.set_starting_floor(2)

        # Equip the given inventory
        builder.set_player_inventory({
            "sword": 2,     # stone sword
            "bow": 1,       # bow
            "arrows": 20,   # 20 arrows
            "torches": 15,  # 15 torches
        })

        # Player spawn position (the up-ladder position on floor 2)
        spawn_pos = builder.player_position

        # Place a water fountain within 2-5 Manhattan on PATH or STONE
        builder.place_randomly_near(
            place_rng,
            level=2,
            block_type=BlockType.FOUNTAIN,
            target_pos=spawn_pos,
            min_dist=2,
            max_dist=5,
            n=1,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH, BlockType.STONE],
        )

        # Add 2 melee Gnome Warriors (type_id=1) within 5-12 on PATH or STONE
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            mob_rng1,
            level=2,
            mob_name="melee",
            type_id=1,
            n=2,
            target_pos=spawn_pos,
            min_dist=5,
            max_dist=12,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH, BlockType.STONE],
        )

        # Add 1 ranged Gnome Archer (type_id=1) within 5-12 on PATH or STONE
        builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(
            mob_rng2,
            level=2,
            mob_name="ranged",
            type_id=1,
            n=1,
            target_pos=spawn_pos,
            min_dist=5,
            max_dist=12,
            on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH, BlockType.STONE],
        )

        # Build the initial state
        state = builder.build(rng)

        # Mark pre‑completed achievements as True
        achievements = state.achievements
        for ach in self.completed_achievements:
            achievements = achievements.at[ach.value].set(True)
        state = state.replace(achievements=achievements)

        return state</data>
