      <data key="d2">Objective: Clear the Dungeon by killing at least five hostile mobs and descend to the Gnomish Mines, training endurance under the dungeon’s darkness and natural spawning while starting with only a stone sword and torches.

Description: The agent begins on floor 1 (the Dungeon) at the Ladder‑Up position, equipped with a stone sword (tier 2, inventory: `{"sword": 2, "torches": 10}`) and fully satisfied needs (health 9, food 9, drink 9, energy 9, mana 9). All attributes are base (strength=1, dexterity=1, intelligence=1). Two orcs are placed on PATH tiles within Manhattan distance 5–10 from the start: one Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) and one Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2). The victory condition is to descend the Ladder Down, which requires killing five hostile monsters (`monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 5`). Natural hostile spawning is at full intensity (`melee_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`, `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`), while passive spawning is disabled (`passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`). Darkness (level light 0.0) triggers the melee night‑spawn bonus. The agent may place torches to improve visibility and reduce spawn rates, open chests for additional supplies, and optionally ascend to the overworld to gather resources (not required). Mob health and damage remain at their original values (`mob_health_multiplier = 1.0`, `mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0`). All other TaskParams are default. The episode ends with success upon entering the Gnomish Mines.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

