    <node id="task_770">
      <data key="d0">desc_generated</data>
      <data key="d1">generated</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective: Learn to craft a stone sword under time pressure in the dungeon, then defeat two orcs and descend to the Gnomish Mines.

Description: The agent spawns on Floor 1 (the Dungeon) at the Ladder‑Up position with maxed survival stats (health 9, food 9, drink 9, energy 9, mana 9) and base attributes (strength 1, dexterity 1, intelligence 1). The inventory contains exactly the resources needed to build a stone sword and provide light: wood 3, stone 1, torches 4. No sword is provided; the agent must first place a crafting table (consumes 2 wood) on any valid floor tile and then craft a stone sword (consumes 1 wood, 1 stone) using the MAKE_STONE_SWORD action while adjacent to the table. Torches can be placed at any time to improve visibility. Two enemy orcs are hand‑placed on PATH tiles within Manhattan distance 5–10 from the starting position: one Orc Soldier (melee, type_id=2) and one Orc Mage (ranged, type_id=2). Natural hostile mob spawning operates at full intensity (melee and ranged multipliers 1.0, passive multiplier 0.0), and the pitch‑black dungeon (light level 0.0) triggers the darkness bonus for melee spawns. The level‑clear threshold is set to monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 2, so killing the two hand‑placed orcs is sufficient to unlock the Ladder Down. Any additional mobs that spawn add pressure but are not required. The agent succeeds by descending the Ladder Down to Floor 2, earning the `ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES` achievement.

Relevant Achievements: PLACE_TABLE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, MAKE_TORCH

World:
- Player: `builder.set_starting_floor(1)`. Inventory: `{"wood": 3, "stone": 1, "torches": 4}`. All stats maxed, attributes 1/1/1.
- Map: `builder.set_monsters_killed(level=1, count=0)`.  
  Hand‑place Orc Soldier: `builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(rng, 1, "melee", 2, n=1, target_pos=player_start_pos, min_dist=5, max_dist=10, on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH])`.  
  Hand‑place Orc Mage: `builder.add_mobs_randomly_near(rng, 1, "ranged", 2, n=1, target_pos=player_start_pos, min_dist=5, max_dist=10, on_blocks=[BlockType.PATH])`.
- Mechanics: `passive_spawn_multiplier = 0.0`, `melee_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`, `ranged_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`. `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 2`. `mob_health_multiplier = 1.0`, `mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0`. All other TaskParams at defaults.</data>
