      <data key="d2">Objective: Master the Dungeon floor‑1 combat‑to‑descent loop, isolating the skill that most directly boosts the global `ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES` success rate.

Description: The agent spawns on floor 1 (the Dungeon) at the default “ladder up” position, holding a wooden sword and nothing else. Survival stats are full (health 9, food 9, drink 9, energy 9, mana 9), attributes are all 1, and no spells are learned. The Dungeon is generated with the standard room‑and‑corridor layout, populated solely with Orc Soldiers (melee) and Orc Mages (ranged). The agent must explore the rooms, defeat a total of 8 hostiles, then locate the ladder down and descend to floor 2. Hunger, thirst, and fatigue accumulate at half the normal rate (`needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.5`) so that survival does not distract from combat practice. All mob stats and spawn rates remain at default. The task terminates successfully when `ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES` is achieved. No Overworld resources, crafting tables, or furnaces are accessible; the only equipment the agent can obtain are bows and arrows from discovered chests, which can be used if the agent chooses. This focused drill forces the agent to refine its melee‑combat rhythm, threat avoidance, and dungeon navigation, directly strengthening the bottleneck that currently limits global progression.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: COLLECT_WOOD, PLACE_TABLE, EAT_COW, COLLECT_SAPLING, COLLECT_DRINK, MAKE_WOOD_PICKAXE, MAKE_WOOD_SWORD, PLACE_PLANT, DEFEAT_ZOMBIE, COLLECT_STONE, PLACE_STONE, EAT_PLANT, DEFEAT_SKELETON, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, WAKE_UP, PLACE_FURNACE, COLLECT_COAL, COLLECT_IRON, COLLECT_DIAMOND, MAKE_IRON_PICKAXE, MAKE_IRON_SWORD, MAKE_ARROW, MAKE_TORCH, PLACE_TORCH, MAKE_DIAMOND_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_ARMOUR, MAKE_DIAMOND_ARMOUR, ENTER_DUNGEON, FIND_BOW, OPEN_CHEST, DRINK_POTION, DEFEAT_ORC_SOLIDER, DEFEAT_ORC_MAGE, EAT_SNAIL, FIRE_BOW (all overworld and early dungeon achievements that the agent would normally acquire before reaching the Gnomish Mines, thereby preventing them from being activated or required during training).

World:
- Player: Starts on floor 1 at the spawn location used when transitioning from floor 0 (the “ladder up” position, typically around the center of the Dungeon). Inventory: {"wood_sword": 1}. All other inventories zero. Attributes: strength=1, dexterity=1, intelligence=1. All vital bars full. No weapon or armour enchantments, no learned spells.
- Map: No modifications to the procedurally generated nine‑level world; all floors use standard generation.
- Mechanics:
  - monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 8 (default; applies to floor 1)
  - needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.5
  - All other TaskParams remain at their defaults (mob_health_multiplier, mob_damage_multiplier, health_recover_multiplier, mana_recover_multiplier, growing_plants_age = 1.0; passive/melee/ranged spawn multipliers = 1.0; melee_trigger_distance = 10).</data>
