      <data key="d2">Objective: Strengthen floor 1 combat endurance by requiring one additional kill before descending to the Gnomish Mines.

Description: The agent starts on floor 1 (the Dungeon) with a stone sword (tier 2) already equipped. All mob spawns remain at reduced intensity: melee mobs (Orc Soldiers) at half rate (`melee_spawn_multiplier = 0.5`), ranged mobs (Orc Mages) also at half rate (`ranged_spawn_multiplier = 0.5`), and passive mobs (Snails) at normal rate (`passive_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`). The critical progression change is the floor‑clearing threshold: `monsters_killed_to_clear_level` is increased from 6 to **7**. The agent must therefore defeat at least seven hostile mobs before the down ladder unlocks. Once the required kills are reached, the agent must locate the down ladder and descend, triggering the `ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES` achievement and ending the episode as a success. All other achievements are incidental; only the descent counts for success. Survival needs, health regeneration, and all other mechanics remain at their default values. This task incrementally pushes the kill demand closer to the full game’s 8‑kill standard while keeping combat difficulty unchanged.

