      <data key="d2">Objective: Descend from the Gnomish Mines (floor 2) to the Sewers (floor 3) by exploring the pitch‑black caverns, fighting Gnome Warriors and Archers, and locating the ladder down.

Description: The episode begins on floor 2 (Gnomish Mines) with the player spawning at the natural ladder‑up position. The floor is completely dark (base light level 0), requiring the agent to actively place torches to navigate. The player is equipped with iron tools, a bow, and a large supply of arrows and torches to focus the challenge on exploration, combat, and survival in the darkness. No terrain modifications are made; the default SmoothGen generation for the Gnomish Mines provides all blocks, including the randomly placed LADDER_DOWN. The agent must defeat 8 hostiles (Gnome Warriors and Gnome Archers) to satisfy the floor‑clear requirement. Once killed, stepping on the ladder down and using the DESCEND action will unlock `ENTER_SEWERS` and end the episode successfully. Mild survival mechanics (needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.5) ensure hunger and thirst are relevant but not overwhelming; passive bats on this floor can be hunted for food (granting EAT_BAT). All achievements from earlier floors (Overworld, Dungeon, Gnomish Mines entry, and crafting up to iron tools) are considered completed and are not required to be performed again.

