The only mechanics change from the default game is that survival‑needs decay at half speed (needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.5) to keep the focus on combat and progression rather than starvation. All mob spawn multipliers, health, and damage remain at standard values (1.0), and the floor‑clearing threshold is kept at 8 kills.

