      <data key="d2">Objective: Train the agent to survive and clear the dark Gnomish Mines (floor 2) using iron tools and torches, and then descend to the Sewers.

Description: The agent starts directly on floor 2 (Gnomish Mines) at the ladder‑up position. It is equipped with an iron sword (tier 3) and iron pickaxe (tier 3), plus 20 torches. The floor is procedurally generated in pitch black darkness (default lighting 0.0). Hostile mobs spawn normally: Gnome Warriors (melee) and Gnome Archers (ranged). The ladder down to floor 3 (Sewers) is locked; the agent must personally defeat at least 8 hostile mobs on floor 2 to unlock and use it. Survival needs are moderately eased (`needs_depletion_multiplier = 0.5`) so that the training focus remains on combat and navigation in darkness with limited torch resources. The task terminates successfully when the agent descends from floor 2 to floor 3, achieving ENTER_SEWERS. All other game mechanics (mob health, damage, spawn multipliers, plant age, etc.) remain at default values.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_SEWERS

Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES, MAKE_IRON_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_PICKAXE

World:
- Player:
  - `builder.set_starting_floor(2)`
  - `builder.set_player_inventory({"sword": 3, "pickaxe": 3, "torch": 20})`
  - `builder.set_player_stats(strength=1, dexterity=1, intelligence=1)` (default)
  - All status bars at max (health 9, food 9, drink 9, energy 9, mana 9)
- Map:
  - `builder.set_monsters_killed(level=2, count=0)` (floor 2 starts uncleared)
  - No other block modifications; default procedural generation for floor 2
- Mechanics:
  - `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 8`              # applied to all floors, requiring 8 kills to unlock the down‑ladder on floor 2
  - `mob_health_multiplier = 1.0`
  - `mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0`
  - `melee_spawn_multiplier = 1.0`
