    <node id="task_879">
      <data key="d0">B</data>
      <data key="d1">generated</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective: Teach the agent to successfully descend from the Overworld to the Gnomish Mines while managing standard survival needs, thereby improving the global reliability of the ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES transition.

Description:  
The agent starts on Floor 0 (Overworld) at the default center spawn. It is equipped with a stone sword (tier 2) and a stone pickaxe (tier 2). The Overworld uses standard procedural generation with default mob spawns. The ladder down to the Dungeon (Floor 1) is initially locked; the agent must defeat at least 8 hostile mobs (melee or ranged) on Floor 0 to unlock it (the default `monsters_killed_to_clear_level` for Floor 0 is 8, and no `set_monsters_killed` override is applied). **Survival needs are now at full speed** (`needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0`), requiring the agent to eat, drink, and rest/sleep while fighting and exploring. Once the Floor 0 ladder is unlocked, the agent must descend, navigate the Dungeon, and defeat at least 6 hostile mobs to unlock the downward ladder to Floor 2 (the Gnomish Mines). The task terminates successfully when the agent descends from Floor 1 to Floor 2, achieving ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES. All other parameters (mob health/damage, spawn multipliers, plant growth, mana, etc.) remain at their default values.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

Completed Achievements: ENTER_DUNGEON, MAKE_STONE_SWORD, MAKE_STONE_PICKAXE, COLLECT_WOOD, COLLECT_STONE

World:
- Player:
  - `builder.set_starting_floor(0)`
  - `builder.set_player_inventory({"sword": 2, "pickaxe": 2})`
  - All attributes at default max (health 9, food 9, drink 9, energy 9, mana 9; stats all 1)
- Map:
  - **No `set_monsters_killed` call** for Floor 0 (the requirement defaults to 8)
  - `builder.set_monsters_killed(level=1, count=0)` (ensures Floor 1 starts uncleared)
  - No other block modifications; default map generation used
- Mechanics:
  - `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 6`              # for Floor 1
  - `needs_depletion_multiplier = 1.0`                # &lt;-- Primary change: restored to default
  - `mob_health_multiplier = 1.0`
  - `mob_damage_multiplier = 1.0`
