      <data key="d2">Objective: Survive the Gnomish Mines and descend into the Sewers.

Description: The agent spawns on floor 2 (Gnomish Mines) at the up‑ladder, already equipped with an iron sword (tier 3) and an iron pickaxe (tier 3). All survival needs (health, food, drink, energy, mana) start at maximum (9). The inventory contains 10 torches for light; no other resources or consumables are given. The Gnomish Mines use standard SmoothGen terrain with stone, paths, stalagmites, and ores, and are permanently dark (light = 0.0). The floor is populated with Gnome Warriors (melee, 9 HP, 4 damage) and Gnome Archers (ranged, 6 HP, 2 damage). The ladder down to floor 3 (Sewers) is initially locked; the agent must defeat at least 6 hostile mobs on floor 2 to clear it. Once cleared, the agent must locate and use the ladder to descend. The episode terminates with success when the agent enters the Sewers for the first time (ENTER_SEWERS achievement). By starting directly at the Gnomish Mines with iron‑tier equipment and torches, the task isolates the new combat challenges (tougher melee and ranged foes) and darkness navigation, while eliminating the overhead of earlier‑floor resource gathering and crafting.

Relevant Achievements: ENTER_SEWERS

Completed Achievements: MAKE_IRON_SWORD, MAKE_IRON_PICKAXE, ENTER_DUNGEON, ENTER_GNOMISH_MINES

World:
- Player:
  - `builder.set_starting_floor(2)` (spawn at the Gnomish Mines up‑ladder).
  - `builder.set_player_inventory({"sword": 3, "pickaxe": 3, "torch": 10})` (iron sword and iron pickaxe, plus 10 torches).
  - All player stats (health, food, drink, energy, mana) start at 9 (full). Attributes remain default (Strength=1, Dexterity=1, Intelligence=1).
- Map:
  - No block modifications; all floors use standard generation.
- Mechanics:
  - `monsters_killed_to_clear_level = 6` (applied to floor 2; all other floors keep default 8 except floor 0 which remains 0).
  - All other TaskParams remain at their default values (spawn multipliers 1.0, survival rates 1.0, etc.).</data>
