      <data key="d2">Objective: Teach the agent to survive, fight, and explore the Gnomish Mines to reach the Sewers, thereby improving the global reliability of the ENTER_SEWERS transition.

Description:
The agent starts on Floor 2 (Gnomish Mines) at the up‑ladder position. Its inventory matches what a competent agent would have after clearing the Overworld and Dungeon: stone sword (tier 2), stone pickaxe (tier 2), a bow, arrows, and torches. All survival needs are active at default rates, but the agent begins fully fed, watered, and rested to avoid immediate death. The floor is pitch black, so the agent must use torches to see and move. It must defeat at least 6 hostile mobs (Gnome Warriors and Archers) to unlock the ladder down to the Sewers (Floor 3). Success is achieved when the agent descends from Floor 2 to Floor 3, unlocking ENTER_SEWERS. All other game parameters (mob health/damage, spawn multipliers, etc.) remain at default values.

